/* ============================================================
   Fasahar Al'umma — data.js
   All content lives here. Edit this file, nothing else.
   ============================================================

   IMPORTANT:
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   • Existing IDs have been preserved.
   • The data structure has NOT been changed.
   • The quiz format remains the same so existing functionality
     continues to work.
   • Every user-facing string has two versions: _ha and _en.
   • If video: "" the video card will not show.
   • In read_ha / read_en:
       **bold text**
       - bullet point
       Plain paragraphs separated by a blank line.
   • Never change an "id" once learners have started using app.
   ============================================================ */

