    /* ============================================================
       MODULE 1 — PHONE & INTERNET BASICS
       ============================================================ */
    {
      id: "phone-internet",
      order: 1,
      icon: "📱",
      title_ha: "Tushen Waya da Yanar Gizo",
      title_en: "Phone & Internet Basics",
      desc_ha: "Koyi yadda wayarka take aiki, yadda ake amfani da Internet da browser, yadda ake bincike a Google, sauke manhajoji, da aika fayiloli cikin tsari da aminci.",
      desc_en: "Learn how your phone works, how to use the internet and a browser, search Google, download apps, and share files safely.",
      examPassMark: 70,

      lessons: [

        /* ---------------- LESSON 1 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "phone-l1",
          order: 1,
          title_ha: "Menene Wayar Zamani?",
          title_en: "What is a Smartphone?",
          video: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/9Tk1jNWQx3o?si=_YdksU0A-T7E-BUm",

          read_ha:
            "Wayar zamani, wato **smartphone**, ba waya ce ta kira kawai ba. Karamar kwamfuta ce da ke cikin hannunka wadda za ta iya taimaka maka wajen sadarwa, koyo, aiki, kasuwanci, nishaɗi da samun bayanai.\n\n" +

            "**Me ya sa ake kiran ta smartphone?**\n" +
            "Saboda tana iya yin ayyuka da yawa ta amfani da apps, internet, camera, GPS, microphone da sauran kayan cikin waya.\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da smartphone za ta iya yi:**\n" +
            "- Yin kira da karɓar kira\n" +
            "- Aika da karɓar SMS da saƙonnin WhatsApp\n" +
            "- Haɗuwa da internet ta mobile data ko Wi-Fi\n" +
            "- Bincika bayanai a Google\n" +
            "- Kallon bidiyo a YouTube\n" +
            "- Ɗaukar hotuna da bidiyo\n" +
            "- Aika da karɓar fayiloli\n" +
            "- Karanta littattafai da PDFs\n" +
            "- Yin karatu online\n" +
            "- Amfani da email\n" +
            "- Yin kasuwanci\n" +
            "- Amfani da mobile banking da sauran sabis na kuɗi\n" +
            "- Amfani da AI wajen koyo da aiki\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da za ka gani a wayarka:**\n" +
            "- **Screen:** Fuskar da kake gani kuma kake taɓawa.\n" +
            "- **Settings:** Wurin da ake canza saitunan waya.\n" +
            "- **Apps:** Shirye-shiryen da ke ba ka damar yin ayyuka daban-daban.\n" +
            "- **Camera:** Ɗaukar hoto da bidiyo.\n" +
            "- **Browser:** Manhajar da ake amfani da ita wajen shiga websites, kamar Chrome ko Safari.\n" +
            "- **Wi-Fi:** Hanyar haɗa waya da internet ta hanyar network mara waya.\n" +
            "- **Mobile Data:** Internet da SIM/network ɗinka ke samarwa.\n" +
            "- **Battery:** Wutar da wayar ke amfani da ita.\n" +
            "- **Storage:** Wurin da hotuna, bidiyo, apps da fayiloli suke ajiye.\n\n" +

            "**Mobile Data da Wi-Fi ba abu ɗaya ba ne.**\n" +
            "Mobile Data yana amfani da network na SIM ɗinka, kamar MTN, Airtel, Glo ko 9mobile. Wi-Fi kuma yana haɗa wayarka da wani internet network, misali Wi-Fi na gida, makaranta, ofis ko public hotspot.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kula da amfani da data.**\n" +
            "Bidiyo, downloads da wasu apps suna iya cin data da yawa. Idan kana da ƙaramin data, ka rage kallon bidiyo mai high quality, ka kashe automatic downloads idan ba ka buƙata, kuma ka duba wane app ne ke amfani da data mai yawa.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kula da storage.**\n" +
            "Idan storage ya cika, wayarka na iya yin jinkiri kuma wasu apps su kasa yin aiki yadda ya kamata. Ka riƙa share fayilolin da ba ka buƙata, amma kada ka share abu mai muhimmanci kafin ka tabbatar kana da backup.\n\n" +

            "Muhimmin abu shi ne ka gane cewa waya kayan aiki ce. Za ka iya amfani da ita wajen samun ilimi, neman dama, sadarwa da aiki — ba nishaɗi kawai ba.",

          read_en:
            "A **smartphone** is not just a device for making calls. It is a small computer in your hand that can help you communicate, learn, work, run a business, find information, and entertain yourself.\n\n" +

            "**Why is it called a smartphone?**\n" +
            "Because it can perform many tasks using apps, the internet, a camera, GPS, a microphone, and other built-in features.\n\n" +

            "**Things a smartphone can do:**\n" +
            "- Make and receive calls\n" +
            "- Send and receive SMS and WhatsApp messages\n" +
            "- Connect to the internet through mobile data or Wi-Fi\n" +
            "- Search for information on Google\n" +
            "- Watch videos on YouTube\n" +
            "- Take photos and videos\n" +
            "- Send and receive files\n" +
            "- Read books and PDFs\n" +
            "- Study online\n" +
            "- Use email\n" +
            "- Run a business\n" +
            "- Use mobile banking and other financial services\n" +
            "- Use AI for learning and work\n\n" +

            "**Things you will see on a smartphone:**\n" +
            "- **Screen:** The display you touch and interact with.\n" +
            "- **Settings:** Where you control how the phone works.\n" +
            "- **Apps:** Programs that perform different tasks.\n" +
            "- **Camera:** Used for photos and videos.\n" +
            "- **Browser:** An app used to visit websites, such as Chrome or Safari.\n" +
            "- **Wi-Fi:** A wireless way to connect to an internet network.\n" +
            "- **Mobile Data:** Internet provided through your mobile network.\n" +
            "- **Battery:** The power source for the phone.\n" +
            "- **Storage:** Space where photos, videos, apps, and files are stored.\n\n" +

            "**Mobile Data and Wi-Fi are not the same thing.**\n" +
            "Mobile Data uses your SIM/network provider, such as MTN, Airtel, Glo, or 9mobile. Wi-Fi connects your phone to another internet network, such as a home, school, office, or public hotspot.\n\n" +

            "**Be careful with data usage.**\n" +
            "Videos, downloads, and some apps can consume a lot of data. If your data is limited, reduce high-quality video streaming, disable automatic downloads when unnecessary, and check which apps are consuming the most data.\n\n" +

            "**Pay attention to storage.**\n" +
            "When storage is full, your phone may become slower and some apps may stop working properly. Delete files you no longer need, but make sure important files are backed up before deleting them.\n\n" +

            "The important lesson is that your phone is a tool. You can use it to learn, find opportunities, communicate, work, and build a business — not only for entertainment.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Wanne daga cikin waɗannan ya fi bayyana smartphone?",
            question_en: "Which of these best describes a smartphone?",
            options: [
              {
                text_ha: "Na'urar kira kawai",
                text_en: "A device only for calls",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Ƙaramar kwamfuta mai iya yin ayyuka da yawa",
                text_en: "A small computer that can perform many tasks",
                correct: true
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Na'urar wasa kawai",
                text_en: "A device only for games",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Na'urar ajiye SIM kawai",
                text_en: "A device only for holding a SIM card",
                correct: false
              }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Smartphone tana kama da ƙaramar kwamfuta. Tana iya sadarwa, amfani da internet, gudanar da apps, ɗaukar hotuna, karatu, aiki da sauran ayyuka.",
            explanation_en: "A smartphone is like a small computer. It can communicate, access the internet, run apps, take photos, support learning and work, and perform many other tasks."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- LESSON 2 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "phone-l2",
          order: 2,
          title_ha: "Bincike a Google",
          title_en: "Searching on Google",
          video: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/1KBwovVb9ls?si=9CX5F3iefceZrJD9",

          read_ha:
            "Google search kayan aiki ne da zai taimaka maka wajen nemo bayanai a internet. Amma akwai muhimmin abu da ya kamata ka fahimta: **ba duk abin da Google ta nuna maka ne gaskiya ba.** Google tana nemo maka shafuka da bayanai; kai ne za ka tantance ko bayanin ya dace kuma ya fito daga tushe mai kyau.\n\n" +

            "**Menene search?**\n" +
            "Search shi ne rubuta kalmomin da suke bayyana abin da kake nema, sannan ka duba sakamakon da search engine ya kawo maka.\n\n" +

            "**Misali:**\n" +
            "Idan kana son sanin yadda ake dafa shinkafa, ba lallai ka rubuta doguwar magana ba. Za ka iya rubuta:\n" +
            "- \"yadda ake dafa shinkafa\"\n" +
            "- \"how to cook rice\"\n" +
            "- \"rice cooking steps\"\n\n" +

            "**Yadda ake yin bincike mai kyau:**\n" +
            "- Ka fara da manyan kalmomin abin da kake nema.\n" +
            "- Ka guji saka kalmomi marasa amfani da yawa.\n" +
            "- Idan sakamakon bai dace ba, canza kalmomin binciken.\n" +
            "- Ka karanta title da description kafin ka buɗe shafi.\n" +
            "- Ka duba ko website ɗin abin dogaro ne.\n" +
            "- Idan bayanin yana da muhimmanci, ka kwatanta shi da wasu tushe.\n\n" +

            "**Misalin bincike:**\n" +
            "Maimakon:\n" +
            "\"Don Allah ina son sanin ko akwai wata hanya da zan iya amfani da ita wajen koyon yadda ake yin CV saboda ina son neman aiki\"\n\n" +
            "Za ka iya rubuta:\n" +
            "**\"how to write a CV for a job\"**\n\n" +

            "Idan kana neman bayanin gwamnati, makaranta, banki ko wani hukuma, ka fi son amfani da **official website** ko official social media account. Wannan yana taimaka maka ka guji bayanan bogi.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kula da sakamakon talla.**\n" +
            "Wasu sakamakon Google talla ne. Talla ba yana nufin bayanin karya ba ne, amma kada ka ɗauka cewa saboda ya bayyana a sama shi ne mafi aminci. Karanta bayanin ka kuma tantance website ɗin.\n\n" +

            "**Ka koya wa kanka tambayoyi uku:**\n" +
            "1. Wanene ya wallafa wannan bayanin?\n" +
            "2. Yaushe aka wallafa ko sabunta shi?\n" +
            "3. Shin akwai wani tushe mai kyau da yake tabbatar da bayanin?\n\n" +

            "Idan ka iya yin bincike mai kyau, internet zai zama babban kayan koyonka. Za ka iya koyon sana'a, neman aikin yi, gano damar karatu, fahimtar wani abu mai wahala, da samun bayanai daga ko'ina.",

          read_en:
            "Google Search is a tool that helps you find information on the internet. But there is one important thing to understand: **not everything Google shows you is automatically true.** Google helps you find information; you still need to judge whether the information is accurate and trustworthy.\n\n" +

            "**What is search?**\n" +
            "Search means entering words that describe what you want to find and then reviewing the results provided by a search engine.\n\n" +

            "**Example:**\n" +
            "If you want to learn how to cook rice, you do not need to type a very long sentence. You can search:\n" +
            "- \"how to cook rice\"\n" +
            "- \"rice cooking steps\"\n" +
            "- \"easy rice recipe\"\n\n" +

            "**How to search effectively:**\n" +
            "- Start with the important words.\n" +
            "- Avoid unnecessary words.\n" +
            "- If the results are not useful, change your search terms.\n" +
            "- Read the title and description before opening a page.\n" +
            "- Check whether the website is trustworthy.\n" +
            "- For important information, compare multiple reliable sources.\n\n" +

            "**Search example:**\n" +
            "Instead of writing a long sentence such as:\n" +
            "\"Please tell me how I can learn to create a CV because I want to apply for a job\"\n\n" +
            "You can simply search:\n" +
            "**\"how to write a CV for a job\"**\n\n" +

            "When looking for information from a government agency, school, bank, or other institution, prefer its **official website** or verified official account. This reduces the chance of following fake information.\n\n" +

            "**Be careful with search advertisements.**\n" +
            "Some results are advertisements. An advertisement is not automatically a scam, but appearing at the top does not automatically mean it is the most trustworthy result. Read and verify the website.\n\n" +

            "**Ask yourself three questions:**\n" +
            "1. Who published this information?\n" +
            "2. When was it published or updated?\n" +
            "3. Is there another reliable source that confirms it?\n\n" +

            "Good search skills can turn the internet into a powerful learning tool. You can learn a skill, find jobs, discover education opportunities, understand difficult topics, and find useful information from almost anywhere.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya fi kyau ka yi idan sakamakon Google ya shafi wani muhimmin bayani?",
            question_en: "What is best to do when a Google result contains important information?",
            options: [
              {
                text_ha: "Ka gaskata shi nan take",
                text_en: "Believe it immediately",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Ka kwatanta bayanin da tushe masu aminci",
                text_en: "Compare it with reliable sources",
                correct: true
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Ka duba sakamako na farko kawai",
                text_en: "Only read the first result",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Ka rufe Google",
                text_en: "Close Google",
                correct: false
              }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Google ba ta tabbatar da cewa duk sakamakon gaskiya ne. Don muhimman bayanai, ka bincika wanda ya wallafa bayanin kuma ka kwatanta shi da wasu tushe masu aminci.",
            explanation_en: "Google does not guarantee that every result is true. For important information, check who published it and compare it with other reliable sources."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- LESSON 3 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "phone-l3",
          order: 3,
          title_ha: "Sauke Manhajoji",
          title_en: "Downloading Apps",
          video: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/E675VFsJxrw?si=oc719Sc32_KOr9WQ",

          read_ha:
            "Manhaja, wato **app**, wani program ne da aka tsara domin yin wani aiki a waya. Misali, WhatsApp don sadarwa ne, YouTube don kallon bidiyo, Google Maps don taswira da wurare, sannan banking apps don wasu ayyukan banki.\n\n" +

            "**Inda ake sauke apps:**\n" +
            "- Android: **Google Play Store**\n" +
            "- iPhone: **Apple App Store**\n\n" +

            "Waɗannan su ne wuraren da ya kamata ka fara nema. Ka guji sauke random APK daga website da ba ka sani ba, musamman idan ba ka fahimci abin da kake girkawa ba.\n\n" +

            "**Yadda ake sauke app daga Play Store:**\n" +
            "1. Buɗe Play Store.\n" +
            "2. Danna search.\n" +
            "3. Rubuta sunan app ɗin.\n" +
            "4. Duba icon da sunan app ɗin.\n" +
            "5. Duba sunan developer.\n" +
            "6. Karanta reviews da rating.\n" +
            "7. Duba permissions idan suna bayyana.\n" +
            "8. Danna Install idan ka tabbatar app ɗin ita ce da kake nema.\n\n" +

            "**Me ya sa developer yake da muhimmanci?**\n" +
            "Akwai apps masu kama da juna. Wani mai zamba na iya ƙirƙirar app mai kama da na wani shahararren service. Duba sunan developer da bayanan app kafin ka girka.\n\n" +

            "**Permissions:**\n" +
            "Wasu apps suna neman damar amfani da camera, microphone, location, contacts ko files. Ka tambayi kanka: *Shin wannan permission ɗin ya dace da aikin app ɗin?*\n\n" +
            "Misali, camera app na iya buƙatar camera permission. Amma idan wani calculator app yana neman damar karanta duk contacts ɗinka, ya dace ka yi tunani kafin ka ba shi wannan damar.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kuma kula da fake apps.**\n" +
            "Kada ka ɗauka cewa saboda app tana da logo mai kyau ko mutane da yawa sun ambace ta a WhatsApp, to ita ce official app. Ka bincika ta cikin official website na service ɗin idan kana da shakku.\n\n" +

            "**Kafin ka install:**\n" +
            "- Ka tabbatar da sunan app.\n" +
            "- Ka tabbatar da developer.\n" +
            "- Ka karanta reviews.\n" +
            "- Ka duba permissions.\n" +
            "- Ka guji apps da suke neman bayanai marasa alaƙa da aikinsu.\n" +
            "- Ka sabunta apps daga official store.\n\n" +

            "Sauke app ba kawai danna Install ba ne. Muhimmin abu shi ne ka san **abin da kake girkawa da kuma wanda ya ƙirƙire shi**.",

          read_en:
            "An **app** is a program designed to perform a particular task on a phone. For example, WhatsApp is used for communication, YouTube for videos, Google Maps for maps and locations, and banking apps for certain financial services.\n\n" +

            "**Where to download apps:**\n" +
            "- Android: **Google Play Store**\n" +
            "- iPhone: **Apple App Store**\n\n" +

            "These should be your first places to look. Avoid downloading random APK files from websites you do not trust, especially if you do not understand what you are installing.\n\n" +

            "**How to download an app from Play Store:**\n" +
            "1. Open Play Store.\n" +
            "2. Tap search.\n" +
            "3. Type the app name.\n" +
            "4. Check the app icon and name.\n" +
            "5. Check the developer name.\n" +
            "6. Read reviews and ratings.\n" +
            "7. Review permissions where available.\n" +
            "8. Tap Install after confirming it is the correct app.\n\n" +

            "**Why does the developer matter?**\n" +
            "There can be many similar-looking apps. A scammer may create an app that looks like a popular service. Check the developer and app information before installing it.\n\n" +

            "**Permissions:**\n" +
            "Apps may request access to your camera, microphone, location, contacts, or files. Ask yourself: *Does this permission make sense for what this app does?*\n\n" +
            "For example, a camera app may reasonably need camera access. But if a simple calculator asks to access all your contacts, think carefully before granting that permission.\n\n" +

            "**Watch out for fake apps.**\n" +
            "Do not assume an app is official just because it has a nice logo or people recommend it in WhatsApp groups. If you are unsure, visit the service's official website and follow its app link.\n\n" +

            "**Before installing:**\n" +
            "- Confirm the app name.\n" +
            "- Confirm the developer.\n" +
            "- Read reviews.\n" +
            "- Review permissions.\n" +
            "- Be cautious of unrelated permissions.\n" +
            "- Keep apps updated through official stores.\n\n" +

            "Downloading an app is not simply about pressing Install. The important skill is knowing **what you are installing and who created it**.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Wanne abu ya fi muhimmanci kafin ka sauke app?",
            question_en: "What is especially important before downloading an app?",
            options: [
              {
                text_ha: "Launin icon kawai",
                text_en: "Only the icon color",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Sunan app, developer, reviews da permissions",
                text_en: "The app name, developer, reviews, and permissions",
                correct: true
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Adadin hotunan app",
                text_en: "The number of screenshots",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Ko app ɗin tana da suna mai gajarta",
                text_en: "Whether the app has a short name",
                correct: false
              }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Duba sunan app, developer, reviews da permissions domin rage haɗarin sauke fake ko harmful app.",
            explanation_en: "Checking the app name, developer, reviews, and permissions helps reduce the risk of installing a fake or harmful app."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- LESSON 4 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "phone-l4",
          order: 4,
          title_ha: "Aika Fayiloli",
          title_en: "Sharing Files",
          video: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/kileMEnEeZw?si=WG9wue6Gy9cmRR_R",

          read_ha:
            "Fayil na iya zama hoto, bidiyo, PDF, Word document, spreadsheet, audio ko wani document da aka ajiye a waya ko computer.\n\n" +

            "**Hanyoyin aika fayil:**\n" +
            "- WhatsApp\n" +
            "- Email\n" +
            "- Bluetooth\n" +
            "- Quick Share ko makamancin haka\n" +
            "- Google Drive da sauran cloud storage\n" +
            "- USB cable\n\n" +

            "**Aika hoto ko bidiyo ta WhatsApp:**\n" +
            "Buɗe chat ɗin mutumin da kake son aikawa → danna alamar attachment/camera → zaɓi photo ko video → tabbatar da wanda za ka aika wa → danna send.\n\n" +

            "**Aika document ta email:**\n" +
            "Buɗe email → Compose → rubuta adireshin wanda zai karɓa → rubuta subject → rubuta gajeren bayani → danna attach → zaɓi document → duba komai → Send.\n\n" +

            "**Ka duba recipient sau biyu.**\n" +
            "Babban kuskure ne ka aika CV, school document, contract ko wani private file ga mutumin da ba shi ne wanda kake nufi ba.\n\n" +

            "**Private information:**\n" +
            "Wasu bayanai suna da matuƙar muhimmanci, kamar passwords, PIN, OTP, bank login details da wasu identity documents. Kada ka aika su ga mutum kawai saboda ya tambaye ka.\n\n" +

            "Wani lokaci legitimate organization na iya neman wani identity document. A irin wannan yanayin, ka tabbatar da cewa organization ɗin gaskiya ce, ka fahimci dalilin da ya sa suke nema, kuma ka yi amfani da official channel ɗinsu. Kada ka aika sensitive information zuwa random WhatsApp number ko email da ba ka tabbatar da shi ba.\n\n" +

            "**Ka tuna:**\n" +
            "Da zarar ka aika fayil, ba ka da cikakken iko kan abin da mai karɓa zai yi da shi. Zai iya save, forward, screenshot ko sake raba shi. Saboda haka ka yi tunani kafin ka aika.\n\n" +

            "**Kafin ka danna Send, tambayi kanka:**\n" +
            "1. Shin mutumin daidai ne?\n" +
            "2. Shin fayil ɗin daidai ne?\n" +
            "3. Shin ina da izinin raba wannan fayil?\n" +
            "4. Shin fayil ɗin yana ɗauke da bayanan sirri?\n\n" +

            "Wannan ƙaramin checking ɗin zai iya hana babban kuskure.",

          read_en:
            "A file can be a photo, video, PDF, Word document, spreadsheet, audio recording, or another document stored on a phone or computer.\n\n" +

            "**Ways to share files:**\n" +
            "- WhatsApp\n" +
            "- Email\n" +
            "- Bluetooth\n" +
            "- Quick Share or similar tools\n" +
            "- Google Drive and other cloud storage\n" +
            "- USB cable\n\n" +

            "**Sending a photo or video through WhatsApp:**\n" +
            "Open the person's chat → tap the attachment/camera icon → choose the photo or video → confirm the recipient → tap send.\n\n" +

            "**Sending a document by email:**\n" +
            "Open email → Compose → enter the recipient → write a subject → write a short message → attach the document → review everything → Send.\n\n" +

            "**Check the recipient twice.**\n" +
            "It is easy to accidentally send a CV, school document, contract, or private file to the wrong person.\n\n" +

            "**Private information:**\n" +
            "Some information is extremely sensitive, such as passwords, PINs, OTPs, bank login details, and certain identity documents. Do not send them simply because someone asks.\n\n" +

            "Sometimes a legitimate organization may need an identity document. In that situation, verify that the organization is genuine, understand why the document is needed, and use its official channel. Do not send sensitive information to a random WhatsApp number or unverified email address.\n\n" +

            "**Remember:**\n" +
            "Once you send a file, you no longer have complete control over what the recipient does with it. They may save, forward, screenshot, or share it again. Think before sending.\n\n" +

            "**Before pressing Send, ask yourself:**\n" +
            "1. Is this the correct person?\n" +
            "2. Is this the correct file?\n" +
            "3. Do I have permission to share it?\n" +
            "4. Does the file contain sensitive information?\n\n" +

            "That small check can prevent a serious mistake.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya kamata ka yi kafin ka aika wani muhimmin fayil?",
            question_en: "What should you do before sending an important file?",
            options: [
              {
                text_ha: "Danna Send nan take",
                text_en: "Press Send immediately",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Tabbatar da recipient, fayil da bayanan da ke ciki",
                text_en: "Check the recipient, file, and information inside it",
                correct: true
              },
              {
                text_ha: "A aika wa kowa",
                text_en: "Send it to everyone",
                correct: false
              },
              {
                text_ha: "Canza sunan fayil kawai",
                text_en: "Only change the file name",
                correct: false
              }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Kafin ka aika fayil, ka tabbatar da wanda zai karɓa, fayil ɗin daidai ne, kuma ba ka aika sensitive information ba tare da dalili da tabbaci ba.",
            explanation_en: "Before sending a file, confirm the recipient and file, and make sure you are not unnecessarily sharing sensitive information."
          }
        }
      ],

      exam: [
        {
          question_ha: "Wanne abu ya fi bayyana smartphone?",
          question_en: "Which best describes a smartphone?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Na'urar kira kawai", text_en: "A device only for calls", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ƙaramar kwamfuta mai iya yin ayyuka da yawa", text_en: "A small computer that can perform many tasks", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Na'urar wasa kawai", text_en: "A gaming device only", correct: false },
