    {
      id: "email-work",
      order: 2,
      icon: "📧",
      title_ha: "Ofis Na Waya da Wasiku",
      title_en: "Email & Digital Work",
      desc_ha: "Koyi yadda ake amfani da email, aika documents, shirya CV, rubuta saƙon neman aiki, da fara neman damar aiki online.",
      desc_en: "Learn how to use email, send documents, prepare a CV, write job messages, and find work opportunities online.",
      examPassMark: 70,

      lessons: [

        /* ---------------- EMAIL LESSON 1 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "email-l1",
          order: 1,
          title_ha: "Buɗe Imel Mai Aminci",
          title_en: "Creating a Safe Email",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Email, wato **imel**, shi ne ɗaya daga cikin muhimman hanyoyin sadarwa a duniyar aiki da karatu. Idan kana neman aiki, tallafi, admission, scholarship, horo ko kana gudanar da kasuwanci, email zai iya zama muhimmin adireshinka na online.\n\n" +

            "**Menene email address?**\n" +
            "Email address kamar adireshin gidan waya ne, amma na internet. Misali:\n" +
            "**sunanmutum@example.com**\n\n" +

            "Email address yana da sassa daban-daban. Akwai sunan mai amfani, alamar **@**, sannan domain na email service.\n\n" +

            "**Yadda ake ƙirƙirar email mai kyau:**\n" +
            "- Yi amfani da suna mai kyau da sauƙin fahimta.\n" +
            "- Idan email ɗin na neman aiki ne, guji sunaye kamar `coolboy123` ko `bigmanxxx`.\n" +
            "- Ka zaɓi password mai ƙarfi.\n" +
            "- Ka saka recovery phone/email idan service ɗin ya ba ka damar yin haka.\n" +
            "- Kunna 2FA idan akwai.\n\n" +

            "**Password mai kyau:**\n" +
            "Kada ka yi amfani da sunanka, 123456, password, ko shekarar haihuwa kawai. Ka fi amfani da password mai tsawo wanda ba sauƙin hasashe ba ne. Kada ka sake amfani da password ɗaya a duk accounts ɗinka idan za ka iya guje wa hakan.\n\n" +

            "**Kada ka raba password.**\n" +
            "Idan wani ya ce shi support ne kuma yana buƙatar password ɗinka, ka dakata ka tabbatar da shi ta official channel. Kada ka ba wani password saboda tsoro ko gaggawa.\n\n" +

            "**2FA:**\n" +
            "Two-Factor Authentication yana ƙara wani mataki na tsaro bayan password. Wannan yana taimaka maka idan wani ya gano password ɗinka.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kula da recovery information.**\n" +
            "Recovery phone number ko recovery email na iya taimaka maka wajen dawo da account idan ka manta password ko aka samu matsala. Ka tabbata bayanan recovery ɗin da ka saka naka ne kuma kana iya samun su.\n\n" +

            "Email ɗinka ya kamata ya zama kamar **mabuɗin ofishin ka na digital**. Ka kare shi saboda account ɗin email na iya zama hanyar dawo da wasu accounts ɗinka.",

          read_en:
            "Email is one of the most important communication tools in education and work. If you are applying for a job, grant, admission, scholarship, training, or running a business, your email can become an important online identity.\n\n" +

            "**What is an email address?**\n" +
            "An email address is like a postal address, but for the internet. Example:\n" +
            "**person@example.com**\n\n" +

            "An email address has different parts, including the username, the **@** symbol, and the email service domain.\n\n" +

            "**How to create a good email:**\n" +
            "- Use a clear and professional name.\n" +
            "- If it will be used for jobs, avoid names such as `coolboy123` or `bigmanxxx`.\n" +
            "- Choose a strong password.\n" +
            "- Add recovery information when available.\n" +
            "- Turn on 2FA.\n\n" +

            "**A strong password:**\n" +
            "Avoid using your name, 123456, password, or only your birth year. Use a longer password that is difficult to guess. Avoid reusing the same password across all your accounts when possible.\n\n" +

            "**Never share your password.**\n" +
            "If someone claims to be support and asks for your password, stop and verify them through the official channel. Never give your password because someone is creating fear or urgency.\n\n" +

            "**2FA:**\n" +
            "Two-Factor Authentication adds another security step after your password. It can protect your account if someone discovers your password.\n\n" +

            "**Protect your recovery information.**\n" +
            "A recovery phone number or email can help you regain access if you forget your password or have an account problem. Make sure the recovery details belong to you and that you can access them.\n\n" +

            "Think of your email as a **digital office key**. Protect it because your email account may also be used to recover other accounts.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Wanne abu ya fi taimakawa wajen kare email account?",
            question_en: "Which helps protect an email account?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Raba password da aboki", text_en: "Sharing your password with a friend", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Password mai ƙarfi da 2FA", text_en: "A strong password and 2FA", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Amfani da 123456", text_en: "Using 123456", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Kashe recovery information", text_en: "Removing recovery information", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Password mai ƙarfi da 2FA suna ƙara tsaron email account.",
            explanation_en: "A strong password and 2FA add important protection to an email account."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- EMAIL LESSON 2 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "email-l2",
          order: 2,
          title_ha: "Aika Fayiloli ta Imel",
          title_en: "Sending Attachments",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Email yana da amfani sosai idan kana son aika **CV, application letter, PDF, hotuna, school documents ko wasu files**.\n\n" +

            "**Muhimman sassan email:**\n" +
            "- **To:** Adireshin wanda zai karɓi email.\n" +
            "- **Subject:** Takaitaccen bayanin abin da email ɗin yake game da shi.\n" +
            "- **Message body:** Babban saƙon da kake rubutawa.\n" +
            "- **Attachment:** Fayil da ka haɗa da email.\n\n" +

            "**Misalin subject:**\n" +
            "**Application for Frontend Developer Internship**\n\n" +

            "Wannan ya fi `Hello` ko `Important` saboda mai karɓa zai fahimci dalilin email kafin ya buɗe shi.\n\n" +

            "**Yadda ake attach file:**\n" +
            "1. Buɗe email.\n" +
            "2. Danna Compose.\n" +
            "3. Saka recipient.\n" +
            "4. Rubuta subject.\n" +
            "5. Rubuta saƙo mai ladabi.\n" +
            "6. Danna alamar paperclip/attach.\n" +
            "7. Zaɓi file.\n" +
            "8. Jira file ɗin ya gama upload.\n" +
            "9. Sake duba email ɗin.\n" +
            "10. Danna Send.\n\n" +

            "**Kafin ka aika:**\n" +
            "- Ka tabbatar email address daidai ne.\n" +
            "- Ka tabbatar ka haɗa file ɗin daidai.\n" +
            "- Ka buɗe file ɗin ka duba idan yana aiki.\n" +
            "- Ka tabbatar ba ka saka bayanan sirri da ba a buƙata ba.\n" +
            "- Ka tabbatar subject ɗin ya bayyana dalilin email.\n\n" +

            "**Idan file ya yi girma:**\n" +
            "Wasu email services suna da iyakar girman attachment. Idan file ya yi girma, za ka iya amfani da cloud storage kamar Google Drive ko wani trusted file-sharing service, sannan ka aika link ɗin.\n\n" +

            "Amma idan ka aika link, ka duba **sharing permission**. Kada ka ba kowa edit access idan kawai yana buƙatar karantawa ko download.",

          read_en:
            "Email is very useful for sending **CVs, application letters, PDFs, photos, school documents, and other files**.\n\n" +

            "**Important parts of an email:**\n" +
            "- **To:** The recipient's email address.\n" +
            "- **Subject:** A short description of the email.\n" +
            "- **Message body:** The main message.\n" +
            "- **Attachment:** A file included with the email.\n\n" +

            "**Example subject:**\n" +
            "**Application for Frontend Developer Internship**\n\n" +

            "This is better than `Hello` or `Important` because the recipient immediately understands the purpose of the email.\n\n" +

            "**How to attach a file:**\n" +
            "1. Open your email.\n" +
            "2. Tap Compose.\n" +
            "3. Enter the recipient.\n" +
            "4. Write a subject.\n" +
            "5. Write a polite message.\n" +
            "6. Tap the paperclip/attach icon.\n" +
            "7. Select the file.\n" +
            "8. Wait for the upload to finish.\n" +
            "9. Review the email.\n" +
            "10. Press Send.\n\n" +

            "**Before sending:**\n" +
            "- Confirm the email address.\n" +
            "- Confirm the correct file is attached.\n" +
            "- Open the file and check that it works.\n" +
            "- Remove unnecessary sensitive information.\n" +
            "- Make sure the subject explains the purpose.\n\n" +

            "**If the file is too large:**\n" +
            "Some email services have attachment size limits. You can upload the file to a trusted cloud storage service such as Google Drive and send a link instead.\n\n" +

            "When sending a link, check its **sharing permission**. Do not give someone editing access if they only need to view or download the file.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Menene aikin Subject a email?",
            question_en: "What is the purpose of the Subject in an email?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ajiye password", text_en: "Store a password", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Bayyana abin da email yake game da shi", text_en: "Explain what the email is about", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ɗaukar hoto", text_en: "Take a photo", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Share account", text_en: "Share the account", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Subject yana taimaka wa mai karɓa ya fahimci manufar email kafin ya karanta saƙon.",
            explanation_en: "The subject helps the recipient understand the purpose of the email before reading it."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- EMAIL LESSON 3 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "email-l3",
          order: 3,
          title_ha: "Rubuta CV",
          title_en: "Writing a CV",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "CV, wato **Curriculum Vitae**, takarda ce da ke taimaka maka ka gabatar da kanka ga employer, organization ko wani wanda yake neman mutum mai wata ƙwarewa.\n\n" +

            "CV ba tarihin rayuwarka gaba ɗaya ba ne. Manufarsa ita ce ya nuna cikin sauƙi **wanene kai, me ka iya yi, abin da ka koya, da irin aikin da za ka iya yi**.\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da CV zai iya ƙunsa:**\n" +
            "- Sunanka\n" +
            "- Lambar waya\n" +
            "- Professional email\n" +
            "- Short profile/summary\n" +
            "- Education\n" +
            "- Skills\n" +
            "- Work experience\n" +
            "- Projects\n" +
            "- Certificates/training\n" +
            "- Achievements idan suna da muhimmanci\n\n" +

            "**Idan ba ka da work experience:**\n" +
            "Kada ka ce ba ka da abin rubutawa. Za ka iya saka projects da ka yi, volunteering, school projects, internship, personal projects, ko wasu ayyukan da suka nuna skill ɗinka.\n\n" +

            "**Misali ga beginner developer:**\n" +
            "- Built a small business website.\n" +
            "- Created a mobile app prototype.\n" +
            "- Worked with HTML, CSS and JavaScript.\n" +
            "- Built a personal portfolio.\n\n" +

            "Wannan ya fi rubuta kawai **\"I know computer\"** saboda ya nuna abin da ka iya yi.\n\n" +

            "**Ka guji abubuwa kamar:**\n" +
            "- Bayanin karya.\n" +
            "- Passwords.\n" +
            "- Bank details.\n" +
            "- OTP/PIN.\n" +
            "- Bayanan da ba su da alaƙa da aikin.\n" +
            "- Dogon bayani mara amfani.\n\n" +

            "**CV mai kyau:**\n" +
            "- Yana da sauƙin karantawa.\n" +
            "- Yana da headings masu kyau.\n" +
            "- Ba ya cike da launuka marasa buƙata.\n" +
            "- Ba shi da spelling errors masu yawa.\n" +
            "- Yana da bayanai na gaskiya.\n" +
            "- Yana nuna skills da suka dace da aikin.\n\n" +

            "Ka kuma gyara CV ɗinka gwargwadon aikin da kake nema. Ba dole ba ne ka aika CV iri ɗaya ga kowane aiki.",

          read_en:
            "A **Curriculum Vitae (CV)** is a document that introduces you to an employer, organization, or someone looking for a person with specific skills.\n\n" +

            "A CV is not your entire life story. Its purpose is to show **who you are, what you can do, what you have learned, and what value you can bring**.\n\n" +

            "**A CV may include:**\n" +
            "- Your name\n" +
            "- Phone number\n" +
            "- Professional email\n" +
            "- Short profile/summary\n" +
            "- Education\n" +
            "- Skills\n" +
            "- Work experience\n" +
            "- Projects\n" +
            "- Certificates/training\n" +
            "- Relevant achievements\n\n" +

            "**If you have no formal work experience:**\n" +
            "You can still include projects, volunteering, school projects, internships, personal projects, and other activities that demonstrate your skills.\n\n" +

            "**Example for a beginner developer:**\n" +
            "- Built a small business website.\n" +
            "- Created a mobile app prototype.\n" +
            "- Worked with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n" +
            "- Built a personal portfolio.\n\n" +

            "This is much stronger than simply saying **\"I know computer\"** because it shows what you can actually do.\n\n" +

            "**Avoid including:**\n" +
            "- False information.\n" +
            "- Passwords.\n" +
            "- Bank details.\n" +
            "- OTPs/PINs.\n" +
            "- Irrelevant personal information.\n" +
            "- Long unnecessary paragraphs.\n\n" +

            "**A good CV:**\n" +
            "- Is easy to read.\n" +
            "- Uses clear headings.\n" +
            "- Avoids unnecessary decoration.\n" +
            "- Has been checked for spelling errors.\n" +
            "- Contains truthful information.\n" +
            "- Highlights skills relevant to the role.\n\n" +

            "You should also adjust your CV for the type of job you are applying for. You do not always need to send exactly the same CV everywhere.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Idan ba ka da formal work experience, me za ka iya saka a CV?",
            question_en: "If you have no formal work experience, what can you include in your CV?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ƙarya", text_en: "False experience", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Projects, training da skills", text_en: "Projects, training, and skills", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Password", text_en: "Your password", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "OTP", text_en: "Your OTP", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Projects, training, school work da personal projects na iya nuna abin da ka iya ko da ba ka taɓa samun formal employment ba.",
            explanation_en: "Projects, training, school work, and personal projects can demonstrate your abilities even without formal employment."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- EMAIL LESSON 4 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "email-l4",
          order: 4,
          title_ha: "Neman Aiki a Kan Layi",
          title_en: "Applying for Jobs Online",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Yanar gizo ta sauya yadda mutane ke neman aiki. Yanzu za ka iya gano aikin da ya dace da kai ba tare da zuwa office da takarda a hannu ba.\n\n" +

            "**Inda za ka iya gano aiki:**\n" +
            "- LinkedIn\n" +
            "- Job websites\n" +
            "- Official company websites\n" +
            "- Government career portals\n" +
            "- Professional communities\n" +
            "- Referrals daga mutane da ka sani\n\n" +

            "**Mataki na farko: Karanta job description.**\n" +
            "Kada ka duba title kawai. Karanta skills, experience, location, working hours, responsibilities da application requirements.\n\n" +

            "**Mataki na biyu: Ka duba ko ka dace.**\n" +
            "Ba dole sai ka cika 100% na requirements kafin ka nema ba. Amma idan aikin yana buƙatar skill mai muhimmanci da ba ka da shi, ka fahimci cewa chances ɗinka na iya raguwa.\n\n" +

            "**Mataki na uku: Shirya CV.**\n" +
            "Ka nuna skills da projects da suka fi dacewa da aikin.\n\n" +

            "**Mataki na huɗu: Rubuta short message.**\n" +
            "Idan application ɗin yana buƙatar cover letter ko email, ka rubuta saƙo mai sauƙi, ladabi, kuma kai tsaye.\n\n" +

            "**Misali:**\n" +
            "\"Hello, I am applying for the position of Junior Web Developer. I have experience building web projects using HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Node.js. My CV and portfolio are attached for your review. Thank you.\"\n\n" +

            "**Ka kula da job scams.**\n" +
            "Ba duk job advert da ka gani online ne gaskiya ba. Wasu scammers suna amfani da sunan kamfani na gaske ko kuma suna ƙirƙirar kamfani na bogi.\n\n" +

            "Kafin ka aika bayanai:\n" +
            "- Bincika company ɗin.\n" +
            "- Duba official website.\n" +
            "- Duba ko job ɗin yana cikin official career page.\n" +
            "- Yi hankali da saƙon da ke matsa maka ka yi gaggawa.\n" +
            "- Kada ka aika OTP, PIN ko password.\n" +
            "- Kada ka biya kuɗi kawai saboda wani ya ce za a ba ka aiki.\n\n" +

            "Ba kowace irin fee ba ce kai tsaye ke tabbatar da scam, amma idan wani yana neman kuɗi don **saki maka albashi, tabbatar da aiki, ko ba ka appointment**, wannan babban warning ne. Ka bincika sosai kafin ka biya wani abu.\n\n" +

            "Ka kuma tuna cewa neman aiki yana iya ɗaukar lokaci. Kada ka karaya saboda application ɗaya ta ƙi. Ka gyara CV, ka ƙara skills, ka nemi damar da ta dace, kuma ka ci gaba.",

          read_en:
            "The internet has changed how people look for jobs. You can now find opportunities without physically visiting every office.\n\n" +

            "**Places to find jobs:**\n" +
            "- LinkedIn\n" +
            "- Job websites\n" +
            "- Official company websites\n" +
            "- Government career portals\n" +
            "- Professional communities\n" +
            "- Referrals from people you know\n\n" +

            "**Step one: Read the job description.**\n" +
            "Do not only read the title. Check the required skills, experience, location, responsibilities, working hours, and application requirements.\n\n" +

            "**Step two: Check your fit.**\n" +
            "You do not always need to meet 100% of the requirements before applying. However, if you are missing an important required skill, understand that your chances may be lower.\n\n" +

            "**Step three: Prepare your CV.**\n" +
            "Highlight skills and projects that are relevant to the role.\n\n" +

            "**Step four: Write a short message.**\n" +
            "If the application requires a cover letter or email, keep it polite, relevant, and direct.\n\n" +

            "**Example:**\n" +
            "\"Hello, I am applying for the position of Junior Web Developer. I have experience building web projects using HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Node.js. My CV and portfolio are attached for your review. Thank you.\"\n\n" +

            "**Watch for job scams.**\n" +
            "Not every job advert online is genuine. Scammers may use the name of a real company or create fake companies.\n\n" +

            "Before submitting information:\n" +
            "- Research the company.\n" +
            "- Check its official website.\n" +
            "- See whether the job appears on the official careers page.\n" +
            "- Be cautious about messages creating extreme urgency.\n" +
            "- Never send OTPs, PINs, or passwords.\n" +
            "- Do not pay money simply because someone promises you a job.\n\n" +

            "Not every fee is automatically proof of a scam, but requests to pay money to **release a salary, guarantee a job, or secure an appointment** are major warning signs. Verify carefully before paying anything.\n\n" +

            "Remember that job searching takes time. Do not give up because one application was rejected. Improve your CV, build your skills, find relevant opportunities, and keep applying.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya kamata ka yi kafin ka nemi aiki online?",
            question_en: "What should you do before applying for an online job?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ka aika bayanan sirri nan take", text_en: "Send personal information immediately", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka karanta job description kuma ka tabbatar da kamfanin", text_en: "Read the job description and verify the company", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ka biya duk wanda ya nemi kuɗi", text_en: "Pay anyone who asks for money", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka aika password", text_en: "Send your password", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Karanta job description kuma ka tabbatar da asalin employer kafin ka aika bayananka.",
            explanation_en: "Read the job description and verify the employer before submitting your information."
          }
        }
      ],

      exam: [
        {
          question_ha: "Me ke ƙara tsaron email?",
          question_en: "What improves email security?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Raba password", text_en: "Sharing your password", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Password mai ƙarfi da 2FA", text_en: "Strong password and 2FA", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "123456", text_en: "123456", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Kashe security", text_en: "Turning off security", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Strong password da 2FA suna ƙara kariya.",
          explanation_en: "A strong password and 2FA improve account protection."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Menene Subject yake yi a email?",
          question_en: "What does the email Subject do?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Yana bayyana manufar email", text_en: "It explains the purpose of the email", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Yana ajiye password", text_en: "It stores a password", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Yana ɗaukar hoto", text_en: "It takes a photo", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Yana share account", text_en: "It deletes the account", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Subject yana nuna abin da email yake game da shi.",
          explanation_en: "The subject tells the recipient what the email is about."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Idan ba ka da work experience, me za ka iya saka a CV?",
          question_en: "If you have no work experience, what can you include in your CV?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Ƙarya", text_en: "False experience", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Projects da training", text_en: "Projects and training", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "OTP", text_en: "OTP", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "PIN", text_en: "PIN", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Projects da training na iya nuna skills ɗinka.",
          explanation_en: "Projects and training can demonstrate your skills."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Me ya kamata ka yi kafin ka nemi aiki daga wani website da ba ka sani ba?",
          question_en: "What should you do before applying through an unfamiliar job website?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Ka bincika employer da website ɗin", text_en: "Research the employer and website", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Ka aika password", text_en: "Send your password", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ka biya nan take", text_en: "Pay immediately", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ka aika OTP", text_en: "Send your OTP", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Bincike da verification suna taimaka maka ka guji job scams.",
          explanation_en: "Research and verification help you avoid job scams."
        }
      ]
    },


    /* ============================================================
       MODULE 3 — WHATSAPP & SOCIAL MEDIA
       ============================================================ */
    {
      id: "whatsapp-social",
      order: 3,
      icon: "💬",
      title_ha: "Sifirin WhatsApp da Soshiyal",
      title_en: "WhatsApp & Social Media",
      desc_ha: "Koyi yadda ake amfani da WhatsApp da social media wajen sadarwa, koyo, kasuwanci da gina kyakkyawar kasancewa online.",
      desc_en: "Learn how to use WhatsApp and social media for communication, learning, business, and a healthy online presence.",
      examPassMark: 70,

      lessons: [

        /* ---------------- WA LESSON 1 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "wa-l1",
          order: 1,
          title_ha: "Tushen WhatsApp",
          title_en: "WhatsApp Basics",
          video: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/eBjYn9SxcZw?si=_A7AvDryJUNGmzou",

          read_ha:
            "WhatsApp manhaja ce ta sadarwa da mutane ke amfani da ita wajen aika saƙonni, hotuna, videos, documents da voice notes, tare da yin voice da video calls.\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da za ka iya yi a WhatsApp:**\n" +
            "- Aika text message.\n" +
            "- Aika voice note.\n" +
            "- Yin voice call.\n" +
            "- Yin video call.\n" +
            "- Aika hotuna da videos.\n" +
            "- Aika documents.\n" +
            "- Ƙirƙirar groups.\n" +
            "- Yin Status.\n" +
            "- Raba location idan kana buƙata.\n\n" +

            "**Ka fahimci Groups.**\n" +
            "WhatsApp group na iya zama na iyali, makaranta, aiki, kasuwanci ko al'umma. Amma ba kowane group ne ya dace ka shiga ba. Ka san wanda ya ƙirƙiri group ɗin da manufarsa.\n\n" +

            "**Unknown numbers:**\n" +
            "Idan lambar da ba ka sani ba ta aiko maka da saƙo, ba lallai ne ka amsa ba. Ka duba saƙon, ka yi amfani da block/report idan ya zama suspicious, kuma kada ka danna links marasa tabbas.\n\n" +

            "**Voice notes:**\n" +
            "Voice note yana da amfani idan rubutu ya yi tsawo, amma idan kana magana da mutum a wurin jama'a, ka kula kada ka fallasa abin da ke cikin saƙon.\n\n" +

            "**Documents:**\n" +
            "WhatsApp na iya aika PDFs, documents da sauran files. Amma ka tuna cewa abin da ka aika zai iya zama saved ko forwarded.\n\n" +

            "**Status:**\n" +
            "Status na iya zama hanya mai kyau wajen raba labarai ko tallata business. Amma kada ka saka bayanan da za ka yi nadama idan mutane sun gani.\n\n" +

            "WhatsApp kayan aiki ne mai ƙarfi. Ka yi amfani da shi don sadarwa da mutane, amma ka haɗa amfani da shi da hankali da tsaro.",

          read_en:
            "WhatsApp is a communication app used for messages, photos, videos, documents, voice notes, voice calls, and video calls.\n\n" +

            "**Things you can do on WhatsApp:**\n" +
            "- Send text messages.\n" +
            "- Send voice notes.\n" +
            "- Make voice calls.\n" +
            "- Make video calls.\n" +
            "- Send photos and videos.\n" +
            "- Send documents.\n" +
            "- Create groups.\n" +
            "- Post Status updates.\n" +
            "- Share your location when needed.\n\n" +

            "**Understand Groups.**\n" +
            "WhatsApp groups can be used for families, schools, workplaces, businesses, and communities. But you do not need to join every group. Understand who created the group and why it exists.\n\n" +

            "**Unknown numbers:**\n" +
            "If an unknown number messages you, you do not have to reply. Review the message, block/report suspicious accounts when necessary, and avoid clicking untrusted links.\n\n" +

            "**Voice notes:**\n" +
            "Voice notes are useful when typing is inconvenient, but be careful about playing or recording sensitive information in public places.\n\n" +

            "**Documents:**\n" +
            "WhatsApp can send PDFs, documents, and other files. Remember that recipients may save or forward what you send.\n\n" +

            "**Status:**\n" +
            "Status can be useful for sharing updates or promoting a business. Avoid posting information you may later regret sharing.\n\n" +

            "WhatsApp is a powerful tool. Use it for communication while keeping privacy and security in mind.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Idan lambar da ba ka sani ba ta aiko maka da suspicious message, me ya fi kyau ka yi?",
            question_en: "What is best to do if an unknown number sends you a suspicious message?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ka danna duk links", text_en: "Click every link", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka yi hankali, ka guji suspicious links kuma ka block/report idan ya dace", text_en: "Be careful, avoid suspicious links, and block/report when appropriate", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ka aika OTP", text_en: "Send your OTP", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka aika password", text_en: "Send your password", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Unknown message na iya zama spam ko scam. Kada ka danna suspicious links ko aika bayanan sirri.",
            explanation_en: "An unknown message may be spam or a scam. Avoid suspicious links and never send sensitive credentials."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- WA LESSON 2 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "wa-l2",
          order: 2,
          title_ha: "Saitunan Sirri",
          title_en: "Privacy Settings",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Privacy settings suna baka damar sarrafa irin bayanan da wasu mutane za su iya gani game da kai a WhatsApp.\n\n" +

            "**Wasu daga cikin settings:**\n" +
            "- **Last seen and online** — yana sarrafa wanda zai iya ganin lokacin da kake online.\n" +
            "- **Profile photo** — yana sarrafa wanda zai iya ganin hotonka.\n" +
            "- **About** — yana sarrafa wanda zai iya ganin bayanin profile ɗinka.\n" +
            "- **Status** — yana baka damar zaɓar wanda zai ga Status ɗinka.\n" +
            "- **Read receipts** — yana sarrafa wasu alamun karantawa, gwargwadon settings.\n" +
            "- **Groups** — yana taimaka maka ka sarrafa wanda zai iya ƙara ka zuwa groups.\n\n" +

            "**Me ya sa privacy yake da muhimmanci?**\n" +
            "Idan ka bar bayanai a buɗe ga kowa, mutane da ba ka sani ba na iya samun bayanai game da kai. Wannan ba yana nufin duk wanda ya ga profile photo ɗinka zai cutar da kai ba, amma rage bayanan da ba dole ba yana taimakawa wajen kare sirri.\n\n" +

            "**Ka yi tunani kafin ka saka Status.**\n" +
            "Ka tambayi kanka: Shin ina son duk mutanen da ke da damar ganin Status ɗina su ga wannan? Idan amsar a'a ce, ka canza audience.\n\n" +

            "**Privacy ba yana nufin ka daina amfani da social media ba.**\n" +
            "Yana nufin ka fahimci abin da kake rabawa da wanda kake rabawa.\n\n" +

            "Ka duba privacy settings ɗinka lokaci zuwa lokaci saboda apps suna iya ƙara sabbin features ko canza inda settings suke.",

          read_en:
            "Privacy settings allow you to control what other people can see about you on WhatsApp.\n\n" +

            "**Some important settings:**\n" +
            "- **Last seen and online** — controls who can see when you are online.\n" +
            "- **Profile photo** — controls who can see your profile photo.\n" +
            "- **About** — controls who can see your profile information.\n" +
            "- **Status** — lets you choose who sees your Status updates.\n" +
            "- **Read receipts** — controls certain read indicators depending on your settings.\n" +
            "- **Groups** — helps control who can add you to groups.\n\n" +

            "**Why does privacy matter?**\n" +
            "If too much information is public, people you do not know may learn things about you. This does not mean everyone who sees your profile is dangerous, but limiting unnecessary information can improve privacy.\n\n" +

            "**Think before posting a Status.**\n" +
            "Ask yourself: Do I want everyone who can see my Status to see this? If not, adjust the audience.\n\n" +

            "**Privacy does not mean avoiding social media.**\n" +
            "It means understanding what you share and who can access it.\n\n" +

            "Review your privacy settings from time to time because apps can introduce new features or move settings.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Menene amfanin privacy settings?",
            question_en: "What is the purpose of privacy settings?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Su share WhatsApp", text_en: "To delete WhatsApp", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Su taimaka maka sarrafa wanda zai ga wasu bayananka", text_en: "To help control who can see some of your information", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Su ƙara data", text_en: "To add data", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Su canza SIM", text_en: "To change your SIM", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Privacy settings suna taimaka maka ka sarrafa wanda zai iya ganin wasu bayanan profile da activities.",
            explanation_en: "Privacy settings help you control who can access certain profile information and activities."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- WA LESSON 3 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "wa-l3",
          order: 3,
          title_ha: "Soshiyal Media",
          title_en: "Social Media",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Social media kamar Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, X da sauran platforms suna taimaka wa mutane wajen sadarwa, koyo, nishaɗi, kasuwanci da gina online presence.\n\n" +

            "Amma social media ba kawai wurin kallon videos ba ne. Idan ka yi amfani da shi da kyau, zai iya zama kayan aiki na **ilimi, networking da kasuwanci**.\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da za ka iya yi:**\n" +
            "- Koyon sababbin skills.\n" +
            "- Bin organizations da mutane masu ilimi.\n" +
            "- Tallata business.\n" +
            "- Gina personal brand.\n" +
            "- Nemo communities masu amfani.\n" +
            "- Samun labarai da bayanai.\n\n" +

            "**Amma ka koyi tantance bayanai.**\n" +
            "Mutum zai iya yin post mai kyau ba tare da bayanin ya zama gaskiya ba. Hotuna da videos ma za a iya gyara su. Ka duba source kafin ka yada wani muhimmin bayani.\n\n" +

            "**Ka guji oversharing.**\n" +
            "Kada ka saka abubuwa kamar passwords, OTP, PIN, bank login details ko wasu bayanan sirri a public post.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kula da phishing.**\n" +
            "Wani zai iya turo maka da saƙo kamar:\n" +
            "\"Congratulations! You have won ₦500,000. Click here to claim.\"\n\n" +
            "Kada ka danna nan take. Tambayi kanka: Shin na shiga wata competition? Shin account ɗin official ne? Ina iya tabbatar da wannan offer ta official website?\n\n" +

            "**Ka gina kyakkyawar digital footprint.**\n" +
            "Digital footprint shi ne tarihin abubuwan da ka yi ko ka wallafa online. Post ɗin da ka yi yau zai iya zama abin da wani employer ko organization ya gani nan gaba.\n\n" +

            "Ka yi amfani da social media don gina kanka, ba don lalata damar da za ka samu nan gaba ba.",

          read_en:
            "Social media platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, X, and others help people communicate, learn, entertain themselves, run businesses, and build an online presence.\n\n" +

            "Social media is not only for watching videos. Used properly, it can become a tool for **education, networking, and business**.\n\n" +

            "**Things you can do:**\n" +
            "- Learn new skills.\n" +
            "- Follow educational organizations and professionals.\n" +
            "- Promote a business.\n" +
            "- Build a personal brand.\n" +
            "- Join useful communities.\n" +
            "- Find news and information.\n\n" +

            "**Learn to verify information.**\n" +
            "Someone can create a convincing post without the information being true. Images and videos can also be edited. Check the source before sharing important information.\n\n" +

            "**Avoid oversharing.**\n" +
            "Do not post passwords, OTPs, PINs, bank login details, or other sensitive information publicly.\n\n" +

            "**Watch for phishing.**\n" +
            "Someone may send a message such as:\n" +
            "\"Congratulations! You have won ₦500,000. Click here to claim.\"\n\n" +
            "Do not click immediately. Ask: Did I enter a competition? Is the account official? Can I verify the offer through the official website?\n\n" +

            "**Build a good digital footprint.**\n" +
            "Your digital footprint is the history of things you post or do online. A post you make today may be seen by an employer or organization in the future.\n\n" +

            "Use social media to build yourself and protect opportunities you may need later.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya kamata ka yi idan ka ga wani muhimmin bayani a social media?",
            question_en: "What should you do when you see important information on social media?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ka yada shi nan take", text_en: "Share it immediately", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka bincika source ɗin ka tabbatar", text_en: "Check and verify the source", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ka gaskata saboda yana da likes da yawa", text_en: "Believe it because it has many likes", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka ɗauka duk gaskiya ne", text_en: "Assume it is all true", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Likes da views ba su tabbatar da gaskiyar bayani ba. Ka bincika source.",
            explanation_en: "Likes and views do not prove that information is true. Verify the source."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- WA LESSON 4 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "wa-l4",
          order: 4,
          title_ha: "WhatsApp Business",
          title_en: "WhatsApp Business",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "WhatsApp Business an tsara ta musamman domin businesses da mutanen da suke hulɗa da customers ta WhatsApp.\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da WhatsApp Business za ta iya taimaka maka da su:**\n" +
            "- Business profile.\n" +
            "- Business description.\n" +
            "- Business hours.\n" +
            "- Product catalog.\n" +
            "- Greeting messages.\n" +
            "- Away messages.\n" +
            "- Quick replies.\n" +
            "- Labels don tsara conversations.\n\n" +

            "**Business profile:**\n" +
            "Ka saka sunan business, bayanin abin da kake sayarwa, hours idan kana da su, da sauran bayanan da suka dace.\n\n" +

            "**Catalog:**\n" +
            "Za ka iya saka product name, price, description da photo. Wannan yana ba customer damar fahimtar kayan da kake sayarwa kafin ya yi tambaya.\n\n" +

            "**Quick replies:**\n" +
            "Idan customers suna tambayar abu iri ɗaya, za ka iya shirya amsa da za ka sake amfani da ita. Amma ka karanta saƙon customer kafin ka aika canned response domin kada amsar ta zama ba ta dace ba.\n\n" +

            "**Greeting da Away messages:**\n" +
            "Za su iya sanar da customer cewa ka karɓi saƙonsa ko kuma ba ka nan a lokacin.\n\n" +

            "**Ka tuna:**\n" +
            "WhatsApp Business ba zai maye gurbin kyakkyawar hidimar customer ba. Ka kasance mai gaskiya game da farashi, availability, delivery da quality.\n\n" +

            "Idan ka yi amfani da WhatsApp Business da kyau, wayarka za ta iya zama ƙaramin customer-service desk na business ɗinka.",

          read_en:
            "WhatsApp Business is designed for businesses and people who communicate with customers through WhatsApp.\n\n" +

            "**WhatsApp Business can help with:**\n" +
            "- Business profile.\n" +
            "- Business description.\n" +
            "- Business hours.\n" +
            "- Product catalog.\n" +
            "- Greeting messages.\n" +
            "- Away messages.\n" +
            "- Quick replies.\n" +
            "- Labels for organizing conversations.\n\n" +

            "**Business profile:**\n" +
            "Add your business name, description, business hours, and other useful information.\n\n" +

            "**Catalog:**\n" +
            "You can add product names, prices, descriptions, and photos. This helps customers understand what you sell before asking questions.\n\n" +

            "**Quick replies:**\n" +
            "If customers repeatedly ask the same question, you can create reusable replies. Still read the customer's message before sending a saved response so the answer actually fits.\n\n" +

            "**Greeting and Away messages:**\n" +
            "These can tell customers that you received their message or that you are currently unavailable.\n\n" +

            "**Remember:**\n" +
            "WhatsApp Business does not replace good customer service. Be honest about prices, availability, delivery, and product quality.\n\n" +

            "Used properly, WhatsApp Business can turn your phone into a small customer-service desk for your business.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Wanne feature na WhatsApp Business zai taimaka wajen nuna kayayyaki?",
            question_en: "Which WhatsApp Business feature can help display products?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Product catalog", text_en: "Product catalog", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Alarm", text_en: "Alarm", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Calculator", text_en: "Calculator", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Bluetooth", text_en: "Bluetooth", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Product catalog yana ba business damar nuna kayayyaki, farashi da bayanansu ga customers.",
            explanation_en: "A product catalog lets a business display products, prices, and descriptions to customers."
          }
        }
      ],

      exam: [
        {
          question_ha: "Me ya fi kyau idan unknown number ya turo suspicious link?",
          question_en: "What is best when an unknown number sends a suspicious link?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Danna shi", text_en: "Click it", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ka guje masa kuma ka block/report idan ya dace", text_en: "Avoid it and block/report when appropriate", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Aika OTP", text_en: "Send OTP", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Forward ga kowa", text_en: "Forward it to everyone", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Suspicious links na iya kaiwa phishing ko scam.",
          explanation_en: "Suspicious links may lead to phishing or scams."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Menene amfanin WhatsApp privacy settings?",
          question_en: "What is the purpose of WhatsApp privacy settings?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Sarrafa wanda zai ga wasu bayananka", text_en: "Control who can see certain information", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Ƙara battery", text_en: "Increase battery", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Sauke apps", text_en: "Download apps", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Canza SIM", text_en: "Change SIM", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Privacy settings suna taimaka wajen kare bayananka.",
          explanation_en: "Privacy settings help protect your information."
        },
