        },
        {
          question_ha: "Idan wani random account ya nemi NIN ɗinka, me ya kamata ka yi?",
          question_en: "What should you do if a random account asks for your NIN?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Aika nan take", text_en: "Send immediately", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Tabbatar da organization da official channel", text_en: "Verify the organization and official channel", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Saka a Status", text_en: "Post it on Status", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Aika wa group", text_en: "Send it to a group", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Identity information yana buƙatar kulawa. Ka tabbatar da wanda yake nema.",
          explanation_en: "Identity information requires care. Verify who is requesting it."
        }
      ]
    },


    /* ============================================================
       MODULE 5 — AI BASICS
       ============================================================ */
    {
      id: "ai-basics",
      order: 5,
      icon: "🤖",
      title_ha: "Amfani da Basirar Wucin Gadi",
      title_en: "AI Basics",
      desc_ha: "Koyi menene AI, yadda take aiki a matakin farko, yadda ake rubuta prompts masu kyau, da yadda za ka yi amfani da AI wajen koyo da aiki cikin alhaki.",
      desc_en: "Learn what AI is, how it works at a basic level, how to write useful prompts, and how to use AI responsibly for learning and work.",
      examPassMark: 70,

      lessons: [

        /* ---------------- AI LESSON 1 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "ai-l1",
          order: 1,
          title_ha: "Menene AI?",
          title_en: "What is AI?",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "AI, wato **Artificial Intelligence — Basirar Wucin Gadi**, fasaha ce da ke ba computer systems damar yin wasu ayyuka da suke buƙatar irin ayyukan tunani kamar fahimtar rubutu, gano patterns, samar da rubutu ko hotuna, da amsa tambayoyi.\n\n" +

            "Ba dole AI ta kasance robot mai jiki ba. Yawancin AI da mutane suke amfani da su yau suna cikin apps da websites.\n\n" +

            "**Misalan ayyukan AI:**\n" +
            "- Taimakawa wajen amsa tambayoyi.\n" +
            "- Fassara rubutu daga wani harshe zuwa wani.\n" +
            "- Taimakawa wajen rubuta ko gyara rubutu.\n" +
            "- Taƙaita dogon bayani.\n" +
            "- Taimakawa wajen koyon wani topic.\n" +
            "- Gano abubuwa a hotuna ko documents a wasu systems.\n" +
            "- Taimakawa businesses wajen customer support da content.\n\n" +

            "**Misalan AI tools:**\n" +
            "- ChatGPT\n" +
            "- Google Gemini\n" +
            "- Microsoft Copilot\n" +
            "- Wasu AI tools na rubutu, hoto, audio da coding\n\n" +

            "**AI ba mutum ba ce.**\n" +
            "AI na iya ba da amsa mai kama da ta mutum amma ba yana nufin duk abin da ta faɗa gaskiya ne ba.\n\n" +

            "**AI na iya yin kuskure.**\n" +
            "Wani lokaci AI na iya samar da bayanin da yake kama da gaskiya amma ba daidai ba ne. Wannan shi ake kira hallucination a wasu AI systems.\n\n" +

            "Saboda haka, idan kana amfani da AI wajen health, finance, law, school assignment, news ko wani abu mai muhimmanci, ka tabbatar da muhimman bayanai daga reliable sources.\n\n" +

            "**AI kayan aiki ce, ba madadin tunaninka ba.**\n" +
            "Ka yi amfani da ita wajen samun ideas, fahimta, drafting da learning, amma kai ne ke da alhakin abin da ka yi da amsar.",

          read_en:
            "AI, or **Artificial Intelligence**, is technology that allows computer systems to perform tasks that involve abilities such as understanding text, recognizing patterns, generating content, and answering questions.\n\n" +

            "AI does not have to be a physical robot. Many AI systems people use today are built into apps and websites.\n\n" +

            "**Examples of AI tasks:**\n" +
            "- Answering questions.\n" +
            "- Translating text.\n" +
            "- Helping write or edit text.\n" +
            "- Summarizing long information.\n" +
            "- Helping people learn topics.\n" +
            "- Analyzing images or documents in some systems.\n" +
            "- Supporting customer service and business content.\n\n" +

            "**Examples of AI tools:**\n" +
            "- ChatGPT\n" +
            "- Google Gemini\n" +
            "- Microsoft Copilot\n" +
            "- Other AI tools for text, images, audio, and coding\n\n" +

            "**AI is not a person.**\n" +
            "AI can produce human-like answers, but that does not mean every answer is correct.\n\n" +

            "**AI can make mistakes.**\n" +
            "Sometimes AI generates information that sounds convincing but is wrong. This is often called a hallucination.\n\n" +

            "For health, finance, law, school work, news, or other important topics, verify important information using reliable sources.\n\n" +

            "**AI is a tool, not a replacement for your judgment.**\n" +
            "Use it for ideas, understanding, drafting, and learning, but you remain responsible for how you use its output.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Wanne bayani ya fi dacewa da AI?",
            question_en: "Which statement best describes AI?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "AI ba ta taɓa yin kuskure", text_en: "AI never makes mistakes", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Fasaha ce da ke taimaka wa computer yin wasu ayyuka masu kama da basirar ɗan Adam", text_en: "Technology that helps computers perform tasks associated with human intelligence", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Robot ne kawai", text_en: "It is only a robot", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Waya ce kawai", text_en: "It is only a phone", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "AI fasaha ce da ke ba computer damar yin wasu ayyuka kamar fahimtar rubutu, samar da content da taimakawa wajen amsa tambayoyi.",
            explanation_en: "AI is technology that allows computers to perform tasks such as understanding text, generating content, and answering questions."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- AI LESSON 2 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "ai-l2",
          order: 2,
          title_ha: "Rubuta Prompts",
          title_en: "Writing Prompts",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Prompt shi ne umarnin ko tambayar da ka ba AI domin ta fahimci abin da kake son ta yi.\n\n" +

            "Idan prompt ɗinka bai bayyana abin da kake so ba, AI na iya ba ka amsa mai faɗi ko wadda ba ta dace da bukatarka ba.\n\n" +

            "**Prompt mai kyau yana iya bayyana:**\n" +
            "- Aikin da kake so AI ta yi.\n" +
            "- Wanda ake rubuta wa.\n" +
            "- Harshen da kake so.\n" +
            "- Tsawon amsar.\n" +
            "- Salon rubutu.\n" +
            "- Bayanan da ya kamata ta yi amfani da su.\n" +
            "- Abin da ba ka so.\n\n" +

            "**Prompt mai rauni:**\n" +
            "\"Rubuta CV.\"\n\n" +

            "**Prompt mafi kyau:**\n" +
            "\"Taimaka mini in tsara CV na beginner web developer. Na san HTML, CSS, JavaScript da Node.js. Ka rubuta shi cikin harshen Turanci mai sauƙi, ya kasance professional kuma ya dace da internship.\"\n\n" +

            "Prompt na biyu ya ba AI ƙarin context. Wannan yana taimaka mata ta samar da amsa mafi kusa da abin da kake buƙata.\n\n" +

            "**Ka iya ba AI role:**\n" +
            "\"Yi kamar kai career coach ne...\"\n\n" +

            "**Ka iya ba AI format:**\n" +
            "\"Ka amsa da bullet points.\"\n\n" +

            "**Ka iya ba AI audience:**\n" +
            "\"Bayyana wa beginner wanda bai taɓa amfani da email ba.\"\n\n" +

            "**Ka iya neman ta tambaye ka:**\n" +
            "\"Idan bayanin bai isa ba, ka fara da tambayoyi uku kafin ka ba ni amsa.\"\n\n" +

            "Ka tuna cewa prompt ba sihiri ba ne. Wani lokaci sai ka gyara prompt sau biyu ko uku kafin ka samu sakamakon da ya dace.\n\n" +

            "**Ka yi experiment.**\n" +
            "Canza wording, ƙara context, ba da example, ko neman wani format. Wannan shi ne yadda za ka ƙware wajen amfani da AI.",

          read_en:
            "A prompt is the instruction or question you give an AI system so it understands what you want it to do.\n\n" +

            "If your prompt is unclear, the AI may produce a broad answer that does not match your needs.\n\n" +

            "**A useful prompt can specify:**\n" +
            "- The task you want done.\n" +
            "- Who the content is for.\n" +
            "- The language.\n" +
            "- Desired length.\n" +
            "- Writing style.\n" +
            "- Important context.\n" +
            "- Things you do not want.\n\n" +

            "**Weak prompt:**\n" +
            "\"Write a CV.\"\n\n" +

            "**Better prompt:**\n" +
            "\"Help me structure a CV for a beginner web developer. I know HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Node.js. Write it in simple professional English for an internship.\"\n\n" +

            "The second prompt gives more context, which helps the AI generate something closer to the user's needs.\n\n" +

            "**You can give the AI a role:**\n" +
            "\"Act as a career coach...\"\n\n" +

            "**You can specify a format:**\n" +
            "\"Answer using bullet points.\"\n\n" +

            "**You can specify the audience:**\n" +
            "\"Explain this to a beginner who has never used email.\"\n\n" +

            "**You can ask for clarification:**\n" +
            "\"If you need more information, ask me three questions before answering.\"\n\n" +

            "Prompting is not magic. You may need to improve your prompt several times before getting the result you want.\n\n" +

            "**Experiment.**\n" +
            "Change the wording, add context, provide examples, or request a different format. This is how you become better at using AI.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya sa prompt mai cikakken bayani ya fi taimako?",
            question_en: "Why is a detailed prompt often more useful?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Yana ba AI ƙarin context", text_en: "It gives the AI more context", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Yana sa internet ya yi sauri", text_en: "It makes the internet faster", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Yana ƙara battery", text_en: "It increases battery", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Yana kashe AI", text_en: "It turns off AI", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Ƙarin context yana taimaka wa AI ta fahimci abin da kake son samu da kuma irin amsar da ta dace.",
            explanation_en: "More context helps the AI understand what you need and produce a more relevant answer."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- AI LESSON 3 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "ai-l3",
          order: 3,
          title_ha: "AI don Koyo",
          title_en: "AI for Learning",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "AI na iya zama kayan aikin koyo mai amfani idan ka yi amfani da ita daidai. Ba wai kawai ka tambaye ta amsar homework ba; za ka iya amfani da ita wajen **fahimta, practice da revision**.\n\n" +

            "**Hanyoyin amfani da AI wajen koyo:**\n" +
            "- Ka nemi ta bayyana wani concept cikin sauƙi.\n" +
            "- Ka nemi misalai.\n" +
            "- Ka nemi ta yi maka quiz.\n" +
            "- Ka nemi ta gano inda ba ka fahimta ba.\n" +
            "- Ka nemi ta tsara maka study plan.\n" +
            "- Ka nemi ta fassara wani bayani zuwa Hausa.\n" +
            "- Ka nemi ta kwatanta concepts biyu.\n\n" +

            "**Misali:**\n" +
            "\"Bayyana photosynthesis kamar kana koya wa ɗalibin secondary school, sannan ka ba ni examples guda uku da tambayoyi biyar na practice.\"\n\n" +

            "Wannan ya fi \"Menene photosynthesis?\" saboda ka bayyana matakin learner da abin da kake son samu.\n\n" +

            "**Ka yi amfani da AI a matsayin tutor.**\n" +
            "Za ka iya cewa:\n" +
            "\"Ka koya mini step by step. Kada ka ba ni amsar tambaya nan take. Ka fara da tambayar ni abin da na riga na sani.\"\n\n" +

            "Wannan yana taimaka maka ka yi tunani da kanka maimakon ka dogara gaba ɗaya da AI.\n\n" +

            "**Ka tabbatar da bayanai.**\n" +
            "AI na iya yin kuskure. Idan kana koyon subject mai muhimmanci, ka kwatanta bayanin da textbook, lecturer, official documentation ko wani reliable source.\n\n" +

            "**Kada ka yi copying kawai.**\n" +
            "Idan makaranta ta ba ka assignment, ka fahimci dokokin makarantar game da AI. Wasu assignments ba sa yarda da amfani da AI kai tsaye. Ko inda aka yarda, ya kamata ka fahimci aikin da ka gabatar.\n\n" +

            "Manufar AI a koyo ita ce ta taimaka maka ka **fahimci abu**, ba kawai ka samu answer ka manta da shi ba.",

          read_en:
            "AI can be a useful learning tool when used properly. You do not have to use it only to get homework answers. You can use it for **understanding, practice, and revision**.\n\n" +

            "**Ways to use AI for learning:**\n" +
            "- Ask it to explain a difficult concept simply.\n" +
            "- Ask for examples.\n" +
            "- Ask it to quiz you.\n" +
            "- Ask it to identify areas you may not understand.\n" +
            "- Ask it to create a study plan.\n" +
            "- Ask it to translate an explanation into Hausa.\n" +
            "- Ask it to compare two concepts.\n\n" +

            "**Example:**\n" +
            "\"Explain photosynthesis to a secondary school student, then give me three examples and five practice questions.\"\n\n" +

            "This is more useful than simply asking \"What is photosynthesis?\" because you have specified the learner level and desired output.\n\n" +

            "**Use AI as a tutor.**\n" +
            "You can say:\n" +
            "\"Teach me step by step. Do not give me the answer immediately. First ask what I already know.\"\n\n" +

            "This encourages you to think instead of depending completely on AI.\n\n" +

            "**Verify information.**\n" +
            "AI can make mistakes. For important subjects, compare its answers with textbooks, lecturers, official documentation, or other reliable sources.\n\n" +

            "**Do not simply copy.**\n" +
            "If your school gives you an assignment, understand its rules about AI. Some assignments may restrict direct AI use. Even when AI is allowed, you should understand the work you submit.\n\n" +

            "The goal of AI in learning is to help you **understand the subject**, not simply get an answer and forget it.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Wanne hanya ce mai kyau ta amfani da AI wajen koyo?",
            question_en: "Which is a good way to use AI for learning?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ka kwafa duk amsar ba tare da fahimta ba", text_en: "Copy everything without understanding", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka nemi explanation, examples da practice questions", text_en: "Ask for explanations, examples, and practice questions", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ka daina karanta littafi", text_en: "Stop reading books", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka gaskata duk amsar AI", text_en: "Trust every AI answer", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "AI ta fi amfani wajen koyo idan kana amfani da ita wajen fahimta da practice, sannan ka tabbatar da muhimman bayanai.",
            explanation_en: "AI is most useful for learning when you use it for understanding and practice and verify important information."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- AI LESSON 4 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "ai-l4",
          order: 4,
          title_ha: "AI don Kasuwanci",
          title_en: "AI for Business",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Ƙananan businesses na iya amfani da AI wajen rage lokacin da ake kashewa a wasu ayyuka. Ba dole ka kasance babban company ba kafin ka fara amfani da AI.\n\n" +

            "**AI na iya taimakawa wajen:**\n" +
            "- Rubuta product descriptions.\n" +
            "- Samar da ideas na social media posts.\n" +
            "- Rubuta customer-service replies.\n" +
            "- Fassara saƙonni.\n" +
            "- Shirya content calendar.\n" +
            "- Taƙaita bayanan meeting.\n" +
            "- Taimakawa wajen research.\n" +
            "- Samar da ideas na sunayen products ko campaigns.\n\n" +

            "**Misalin prompt ga ɗan kasuwa:**\n" +
            "\"Rubuta mini WhatsApp advert na sabuwar takalmi. Target customers su ne matasa. Ka yi Hausa mai sauƙi, ka nuna farashin ₦15,000, kuma ka ƙare da call-to-action mai gajarta.\"\n\n" +

            "AI za ta iya samar da draft, amma business owner ya kamata ya duba shi. Kada ka bari AI ta ƙirƙiri farashi, delivery information ko product claims ba tare da ka tabbatar ba.\n\n" +

            "**Customer communication:**\n" +
            "Za ka iya amfani da AI wajen tsara polite replies. Amma customer na iya tambayar wani abu na musamman wanda template ba zai amsa ba. Kar ka dogara da automation kawai.\n\n" +

            "**AI da bayanan customer:**\n" +
            "Ka yi hankali da personal information. Kada ka saka passwords, OTPs, bank login details ko wasu sirrin customer cikin AI tool kawai saboda kana son ta rubuta saƙo.\n\n" +

            "**AI ba ya tabbatar da business idea.**\n" +
            "Idan AI ta ce product ɗinka zai yi nasara, wannan ba guarantee ba ne. Ka yi market research, ka yi magana da customers, ka gwada product, sannan ka duba results na gaske.\n\n" +

            "AI tana iya zama mataimaki mai kyau, amma business success yana buƙatar fahimtar customer, quality, pricing, trust, delivery da aiki na gaske.",

          read_en:
            "Small businesses can use AI to reduce the time spent on certain tasks. You do not need to be a large company to benefit from AI.\n\n" +

            "**AI can help with:**\n" +
            "- Product descriptions.\n" +
            "- Social media ideas.\n" +
            "- Customer-service replies.\n" +
            "- Translation.\n" +
            "- Content calendars.\n" +
            "- Meeting summaries.\n" +
            "- Research assistance.\n" +
            "- Product and campaign ideas.\n\n" +

            "**Example prompt for a business owner:**\n" +
            "\"Write a WhatsApp advert for a new pair of shoes. The target customers are young people. Use simple Hausa, include the price of ₦15,000, and end with a short call to action.\"\n\n" +

            "AI can create a draft, but the business owner should review it. Do not let AI invent prices, delivery details, or product claims without checking them.\n\n" +

            "**Customer communication:**\n" +
            "AI can help prepare polite replies. But customers may ask specific questions that templates cannot answer. Do not rely only on automation.\n\n" +

            "**AI and customer data:**\n" +
            "Be careful with personal information. Do not paste passwords, OTPs, bank login details, or private customer information into an AI tool simply to generate a message.\n\n" +

            "**AI does not prove that a business idea will succeed.**\n" +
            "If AI says your product will succeed, that is not a guarantee. Do market research, talk to customers, test the product, and examine real results.\n\n" +

            "AI can be a useful assistant, but business success still requires understanding customers, quality, pricing, trust, delivery, and real execution.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya kamata business owner ya yi da amsar AI kafin ya wallafa talla?",
            question_en: "What should a business owner do before publishing AI-generated advertising?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ya wallafa ba tare da karantawa ba", text_en: "Publish without reading it", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ya duba ya gyara facts, farashi da bayanan kaya", text_en: "Review and correct facts, prices, and product information", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ya aika password", text_en: "Send a password", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ya gaskata duk abin da AI ta ce", text_en: "Believe everything AI says", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "AI na iya yin kuskure ko ƙirƙirar bayanan da ba daidai ba. Business owner ne ke da alhakin tabbatar da bayanan.",
            explanation_en: "AI can make mistakes or generate incorrect details. The business owner is responsible for checking the information."
          }
        }
      ],

      exam: [
        {
          question_ha: "Menene AI?",
          question_en: "What is AI?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Robot kawai", text_en: "Only a robot", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Fasahar computer da ke iya yin wasu ayyuka masu kama da basirar ɗan Adam", text_en: "Computer technology that can perform tasks associated with human intelligence", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Waya kawai", text_en: "Only a phone", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Internet kawai", text_en: "Only the internet", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "AI fasaha ce da ke taimakawa computer systems wajen yin wasu ayyuka masu buƙatar irin fahimta ko pattern recognition.",
          explanation_en: "AI helps computer systems perform tasks involving abilities such as understanding and pattern recognition."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Me ke sa prompt ya fi amfani?",
          question_en: "What makes a prompt more useful?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Ƙarin context da bayani", text_en: "More context and useful detail", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Password", text_en: "A password", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Dogon emoji", text_en: "Many emojis", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Rashin bayani", text_en: "No information", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Context yana taimaka wa AI ta fahimci aikin da kake so.",
          explanation_en: "Context helps AI understand what you need."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Me ya kamata ka yi idan AI ta ba ka muhimmin bayani?",
          question_en: "What should you do when AI gives you important information?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Ka gaskata shi kai tsaye", text_en: "Trust it immediately", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ka tabbatar da shi daga reliable sources", text_en: "Verify it using reliable sources", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Ka share internet", text_en: "Delete the internet", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ka aika OTP", text_en: "Send an OTP", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "AI na iya yin kuskure. Ka tabbatar da muhimman bayanai.",
          explanation_en: "AI can make mistakes. Verify important information."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Me ya kamata business owner ya yi kafin ya yi amfani da AI-generated content?",
          question_en: "What should a business owner do before using AI-generated content?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Ya duba facts da bayanai", text_en: "Review the facts and information", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Ya wallafa kai tsaye", text_en: "Publish immediately", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ya ba AI password", text_en: "Give AI a password", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ya cire duk bayanan business", text_en: "Remove all business information", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "AI-generated content yana buƙatar human review.",
          explanation_en: "AI-generated content should be reviewed by a human."
        }
      ]
    },


    /* ============================================================
       MODULE 6 — DIGITAL BUSINESS
       ============================================================ */
    {
      id: "digital-business",
      order: 6,
      icon: "💰",
      title_ha: "Kasuwancin Zamani ta Waya",
      title_en: "Digital Business",
      desc_ha: "Koyi yadda za ka gabatar da kaya online, tallata su, karɓi kuɗi cikin tsari, kuma kula da abokan ciniki.",
      desc_en: "Learn how to present products online, market them, receive payments safely, and serve customers well.",
      examPassMark: 70,

      lessons: [

        /* ---------------- BUSINESS LESSON 1 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "biz-l1",
          order: 1,
          title_ha: "Sayarwa a Kan Layi",
          title_en: "Selling Online",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Digital business yana nufin amfani da internet da digital tools wajen sayar da kaya ko services, samun customers, sadarwa da su, da gudanar da wani ɓangare na kasuwanci.\n\n" +

            "Ba dole sai kana da babban shago ba kafin ka fara online business. Wasu mutane suna fara da ƙaramin stock, service, ko skill da suke da shi.\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da kake buƙata:**\n" +
            "- Product ko service da ka fahimta.\n" +
            "- Bayani mai kyau.\n" +
            "- Hoto mai kyau idan kaya ne.\n" +
            "- Farashi ko bayani kan yadda ake samun quotation.\n" +
            "- Hanyar customer zai tuntube ka.\n" +
            "- Hanyar delivery idan ana aika kaya.\n" +
            "- Hanyar karɓar kuɗi.\n\n" +

            "**Inda za ka iya tallatawa:**\n" +
            "- WhatsApp Status.\n" +
            "- WhatsApp Business.\n" +
            "- Facebook.\n" +
            "- Instagram.\n" +
            "- TikTok.\n" +
            "- Website.\n" +
            "- Online marketplaces.\n\n" +

            "**Product listing mai kyau:**\n" +
            "Kada ka rubuta kawai \"Shoes available\". Ka bayyana size, material, color, price, location da delivery information idan sun dace.\n\n" +

            "**Misali:**\n" +
            "\"Men's casual sneakers — sizes 40–45. Available in black and white. ₦18,000. Delivery available within Maiduguri. Message us to order.\"\n\n" +

            "Wannan ya fi customer ya tambaye ka tambayoyi goma kafin ya fahimci abin da kake sayarwa.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kasance mai gaskiya.**\n" +
            "Kada ka yi amfani da hoton product daban da abin da customer zai karɓa. Kada ka ƙirƙiri review na bogi. Kada ka yi alkawarin delivery ko quality da ba za ka iya cika ba.\n\n" +

            "Trust yana da matuƙar muhimmanci a online business. Customer da ya yarda da kai zai iya dawowa kuma ya ba da shawara ga wasu.",

          read_en:
            "Digital business means using the internet and digital tools to sell products or services, reach customers, communicate with them, and manage parts of a business.\n\n" +

            "You do not need a large shop to begin selling online. Some people start with a small amount of stock, a service, or a skill they already have.\n\n" +

            "**What you need:**\n" +
            "- A product or service you understand.\n" +
            "- A clear description.\n" +
            "- Good photos for physical products.\n" +
            "- A price or quotation process.\n" +
            "- A way for customers to contact you.\n" +
            "- Delivery arrangements where needed.\n" +
            "- A payment method.\n\n" +

            "**Places to promote:**\n" +
            "- WhatsApp Status.\n" +
            "- WhatsApp Business.\n" +
            "- Facebook.\n" +
            "- Instagram.\n" +
            "- TikTok.\n" +
            "- A website.\n" +
            "- Online marketplaces.\n\n" +

            "**A good product listing:**\n" +
            "Instead of simply writing \"Shoes available,\" include size, material, color, price, location, and delivery information where relevant.\n\n" +

            "**Example:**\n" +
            "\"Men's casual sneakers — sizes 40–45. Available in black and white. ₦18,000. Delivery available within Maiduguri. Message us to order.\"\n\n" +

            "This saves customers from asking many basic questions before understanding the offer.\n\n" +

            "**Be honest.**\n" +
            "Do not use a misleading product photo. Do not create fake reviews. Do not promise delivery times or quality you cannot provide.\n\n" +

            "Trust is extremely important in online business. A customer who trusts you is more likely to return and recommend you to others.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya kamata product listing mai kyau ta ƙunsa?",
            question_en: "What should a good product listing include?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Hoto kawai", text_en: "Only a photo", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Bayani, farashi da muhimman details", text_en: "Description, price, and important details", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Sunanka kawai", text_en: "Only your name", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Emoji kawai", text_en: "Only emojis", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Customer yana buƙatar isasshen bayani domin fahimtar product da yanke shawarar saya.",
            explanation_en: "Customers need enough information to understand the product and make a buying decision."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- BUSINESS LESSON 2 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "biz-l2",
          order: 2,
          title_ha: "Tallata Kayayyaki",
          title_en: "Marketing Products",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Marketing ba kawai ka ce \"Buy now!\" ba ne. Marketing shi ne yadda kake sanar da mutane game da product ɗinka da kuma nuna musu dalilin da ya sa zai iya amfani da su.\n\n" +

            "**Abubuwan da ke taimakawa wajen tallata product:**\n" +
            "- Hoto mai kyau.\n" +
            "- Video mai kyau.\n" +
            "- Bayani mai sauƙi.\n" +
            "- Farashi bayyananne idan ya dace.\n" +
            "- Customer reviews na gaskiya.\n" +
            "- Call to action.\n" +
            "- Consistent posting.\n\n" +

            "**Ka fahimci customer ɗinka.**\n" +
            "Wanene yake buƙatar product ɗinka? Dalibai ne? Iyaye? ƴan kasuwa? Ma'aikata? Matasa? Idan ka san customer, zai fi sauƙi ka rubuta message da zai yi magana da bukatarsu.\n\n" +

            "**Misali:**\n" +
            "Idan kana sayar da school bags ga ɗalibai, za ka iya nuna durability, size, compartments da price. Ba sai ka yi dogon bayanin da ba shi da alaƙa ba.\n\n" +

            "**Content ideas:**\n" +
            "- Nuna product.\n" +
            "- Nuna yadda ake amfani da shi.\n" +
            "- Amsa tambayar customer.\n" +
            "- Nuna before/after idan ya dace.\n" +
            "- Raba tip da ya shafi product.\n" +
            "- Nuna real customer feedback da izini.\n\n" +

            "**Ka guji karya:**\n" +
            "Kada ka ce product ɗinka \"100% guaranteed\" ko \"best in Nigeria\" idan ba ka da hujjar wannan claim. Kada ka ƙirƙiri review.\n\n" +

            "**Hashtags:**\n" +
            "Hashtags na iya taimaka wajen gano content a wasu platforms, amma ba su maye gurbin quality content ba.\n\n" +

            "Marketing mai kyau yana haɗa **kyakkyawan bayani + audience da ta dace + consistency + gaskiya**.",

          read_en:
            "Marketing is not simply saying \"Buy now!\" Marketing is how you introduce your product to people and explain why it may be useful to them.\n\n" +

            "**Things that help product marketing:**\n" +
            "- Good photos.\n" +
            "- Useful videos.\n" +
            "- Clear descriptions.\n" +
            "- Transparent pricing where appropriate.\n" +
            "- Genuine customer reviews.\n" +
            "- A clear call to action.\n" +
            "- Consistent posting.\n\n" +

            "**Understand your customer.**\n" +
            "Who needs your product? Students? Parents? Business owners? Workers? Young people? Understanding your audience helps you create messages that address their needs.\n\n" +

            "**Example:**\n" +
            "If you sell school bags, you could highlight durability, size, compartments, and price instead of giving unrelated information.\n\n" +

            "**Content ideas:**\n" +
            "- Show the product.\n" +
            "- Demonstrate how it is used.\n" +
            "- Answer common customer questions.\n" +
            "- Show before/after when appropriate.\n" +
            "- Share useful tips related to the product.\n" +
            "- Share genuine customer feedback with permission.\n\n" +

            "**Avoid false claims:**\n" +
            "Do not say your product is \"100% guaranteed\" or \"the best in Nigeria\" unless you can genuinely support the claim. Do not create fake reviews.\n\n" +

            "**Hashtags:**\n" +
            "Hashtags can help content discovery on some platforms, but they do not replace useful content.\n\n" +

            "Good marketing combines **clear information + the right audience + consistency + honesty**.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Me ya fi muhimmanci wajen marketing?",
            question_en: "What is especially important in marketing?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Fahimtar customer da bayar da bayani na gaskiya", text_en: "Understanding customers and providing honest information", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Yawan emojis kawai", text_en: "Many emojis only", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Karya review", text_en: "Fake reviews", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Dogon rubutu koyaushe", text_en: "Always writing long posts", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Marketing mai kyau yana magana da customer da ya dace kuma yana ba shi bayanai masu amfani da gaskiya.",
            explanation_en: "Good marketing reaches the right customer with useful and honest information."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- BUSINESS LESSON 3 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "biz-l3",
          order: 3,
          title_ha: "Karɓar Kuɗi",
          title_en: "Receiving Payments",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Online business yana buƙatar hanyar da customer zai biya maka. A Najeriya akwai hanyoyi daban-daban, kuma ya kamata ka zaɓi wanda ya dace da business ɗinka.\n\n" +

            "**Misalan hanyoyin biyan kuɗi:**\n" +
            "- Bank transfer.\n" +
            "- USSD.\n" +
            "- POS.\n" +
            "- Payment links.\n" +
            "- Online payment gateways.\n\n" +

            "Wasu businesses suna amfani da services kamar Paystack ko Flutterwave wajen karɓar online payments. Ka bincika current terms da fees na service kafin ka yi amfani da shi.\n\n" +

            "**Babban darasi: screenshot ba hujjar payment ba ce.**\n" +
            "Customer na iya turo maka screenshot da aka gyara. Ko screenshot ɗin gaskiya ne, har yanzu abin da ya fi muhimmanci shi ne ka tabbatar da payment a account ɗinka ko dashboard ɗinka.\n\n" +

            "**Misali:**\n" +
            "Customer ya ce:\n" +
            "\"Na tura ₦20,000.\"\n\n" +
            "Ya turo screenshot. Kada ka aika kaya saboda screenshot kawai. Ka duba account ɗinka ko payment dashboard ka tabbatar da transaction.\n\n" +

            "**Ka duba:**\n" +
            "- Amount.\n" +
            "- Sender/reference idan ya dace.\n" +
            "- Transaction status.\n" +
            "- Ko kuɗin ya shiga account ɗinka.\n\n" +

            "**Ka kuma yi hankali da fake payment links.**\n" +
            "Idan wani ya turo maka link da yake cewa ka login domin karɓar kuɗi, kada ka saka password a website da ba ka tabbatar da shi ba.\n\n" +

            "**Refunds da disputes:**\n" +
            "Ka rubuta business policy mai sauƙi game da refund, exchange, delivery da cancellation. Ka sanar da customer kafin ya biya idan waɗannan policies suna da muhimmanci.\n\n" +

            "Tsarin payment mai kyau yana kare kai da customer. Ka riƙa ajiye records na transactions saboda suna taimaka wajen bin diddigin kasuwanci.",

          read_en:
            "An online business needs a way for customers to pay. There are different payment methods in Nigeria, and you should choose what fits your business.\n\n" +

            "**Examples of payment methods:**\n" +
            "- Bank transfer.\n" +
            "- USSD.\n" +
            "- POS.\n" +
            "- Payment links.\n" +
            "- Online payment gateways.\n\n" +

            "Some businesses use services such as Paystack or Flutterwave for online payments. Check the current fees and terms before choosing a service.\n\n" +

            "**The important lesson: a screenshot is not proof of payment.**\n" +
            "A customer can send an edited screenshot. Even if the screenshot is genuine, you should confirm the payment through your account or payment dashboard.\n\n" +

            "**Example:**\n" +
            "A customer says:\n" +
            "\"I sent ₦20,000.\"\n\n" +
            "They send a screenshot. Do not ship the goods based only on the screenshot. Check your account or payment dashboard.\n\n" +

            "**Check:**\n" +
            "- Amount.\n" +
            "- Sender/reference where appropriate.\n" +
            "- Transaction status.\n" +
            "- Whether the money actually arrived.\n\n" +

            "**Be careful with fake payment links.**\n" +
            "If someone sends a link saying you must log in to receive money, do not enter your password into a website you have not verified.\n\n" +

            "**Refunds and disputes:**\n" +
            "Create a simple policy for refunds, exchanges, delivery, and cancellations. Inform customers before payment when these policies matter.\n\n" +

            "A good payment process protects both you and your customers. Keep transaction records so you can track your business properly.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Customer ya turo screenshot na payment. Me ya kamata ka yi?",
            question_en: "A customer sends a payment screenshot. What should you do?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ka aika kaya nan take", text_en: "Ship immediately", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka tabbatar da payment a account ko dashboard ɗinka", text_en: "Confirm the payment in your account or dashboard", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ka tura screenshot ga kowa", text_en: "Forward the screenshot to everyone", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka nemi OTP", text_en: "Ask for an OTP", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Screenshot ba shi kaɗai ke tabbatar da payment ba. Duba account ko payment dashboard.",
            explanation_en: "A screenshot alone does not confirm payment. Check your account or payment dashboard."
          }
        },


        /* ---------------- BUSINESS LESSON 4 ---------------- */
        {
          id: "biz-l4",
          order: 4,
          title_ha: "Sadarwa da Abokan Ciniki",
          title_en: "Customer Communication",
          video: "",

          read_ha:
            "Customer service yana da muhimmanci kamar product ɗinka. Mutum na iya son product ɗinka amma ya daina saye idan yadda aka yi masa magana bai yi kyau ba.\n\n" +

            "**Kyawawan halayen customer service:**\n" +
            "- Ka gaishe customer cikin ladabi.\n" +
            "- Ka karanta abin da ya tambaya.\n" +
            "- Ka ba da amsa mai fahimta.\n" +
            "- Kada ka yi alkawarin abin da ba za ka iya ba.\n" +
            "- Ka sanar da customer idan akwai delay.\n" +
            "- Ka gode masa bayan transaction.\n\n" +

            "**Misalin amsa mara kyau:**\n" +
            "\"Babu.\"\n\n" +

            "**Mafi kyau:**\n" +
            "\"A halin yanzu wannan size ɗin ya ƙare, amma muna da size 42 da 43. Idan kana so, zan iya sanar da kai idan size 41 ya dawo.\"\n\n" +

            "Amsa ta biyu tana nuna customer cewa kana son taimakawa ko da ba ka da abin da ya nema.\n\n" +

            "**Ka koyi sauraron customer.**\n" +
            "Wasu customers ba sa son a tura musu tallace-tallace kawai. Suna son amsar tambayarsu. Ka fara da fahimtar bukatarsu.\n\n" +

            "**Complaints:**\n" +
            "Idan customer ya yi complaint, kada ka fara da gardama. Ka saurara, ka tabbatar da abin da ya faru, ka duba records, sannan ka bayyana abin da za ka iya yi.\n\n" +

            "**Kada ka yi ƙarya.**\n" +
            "Idan delivery zai ɗauki kwana biyu, kada ka ce zai iso cikin awa ɗaya kawai domin ka samu sale.\n\n" +

            "**Ka riƙa adana bayanan orders.**\n" +
            "Suna iya taimaka maka wajen sanin abin da customer ya saya, amount, delivery status da sauran details da suka dace.\n\n" +

            "Customer mai farin ciki na iya dawowa. Amma ko da ba zai dawo ba, kyakkyawar mu'amala tana taimaka wajen gina sunan business ɗinka.",

          read_en:
            "Customer service is as important as the product itself. A customer may like your product but stop buying if the communication is poor.\n\n" +

            "**Good customer-service habits:**\n" +
            "- Greet customers politely.\n" +
            "- Read their question carefully.\n" +
            "- Give clear answers.\n" +
            "- Do not promise what you cannot deliver.\n" +
            "- Inform customers about delays.\n" +
            "- Thank them after a transaction.\n\n" +

            "**Poor response:**\n" +
            "\"No.\"\n\n" +

            "**Better response:**\n" +
            "\"That size is currently out of stock, but we have sizes 42 and 43. If you want, I can let you know when size 41 is available again.\"\n\n" +

            "The second response shows that you are still willing to help even when the exact product is unavailable.\n\n" +

            "**Listen to customers.**\n" +
            "Some customers do not want to receive advertisements immediately. They simply need an answer to their question. Understand their need first.\n\n" +

            "**Complaints:**\n" +
            "When a customer complains, do not immediately argue. Listen, understand what happened, check your records, and explain what you can do.\n\n" +

            "**Do not lie.**\n" +
            "If delivery takes two days, do not promise one hour simply to make a sale.\n\n" +

            "**Keep order records.**\n" +
            "They can help you track what a customer bought, the amount, delivery status, and other relevant information.\n\n" +

            "A happy customer may return. Even when they do not, good communication helps build your business reputation.",

          quiz: {
            question_ha: "Yaya ya kamata ka amsa customer mai complaint?",
            question_en: "How should you respond to a customer complaint?",
            options: [
              { text_ha: "Ka yi gardama nan take", text_en: "Argue immediately", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka saurara, ka bincika matsalar, sannan ka ba da mafita", text_en: "Listen, investigate the problem, and offer a solution", correct: true },
              { text_ha: "Ka yi ignore", text_en: "Ignore them", correct: false },
              { text_ha: "Ka yi musu ƙarya", text_en: "Lie to them", correct: false }
            ],
            explanation_ha: "Kyakkyawan customer service yana buƙatar sauraro, fahimta, gaskiya da ƙoƙarin samar da mafita.",
            explanation_en: "Good customer service requires listening, understanding, honesty, and trying to provide a solution."
          }
        }
      ],

      exam: [
        {
          question_ha: "Me ya kamata product listing ta ƙunsa?",
          question_en: "What should a product listing include?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Hoto, bayani da farashi idan ya dace", text_en: "Photo, description, and price where appropriate", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Emoji kawai", text_en: "Only emojis", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Sunanka kawai", text_en: "Only your name", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Password", text_en: "Password", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Customer yana buƙatar bayanai masu amfani kafin yanke shawarar saya.",
          explanation_en: "Customers need useful information before deciding to buy."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Me ya fi muhimmanci a marketing?",
          question_en: "What is important in marketing?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Gaskiya da fahimtar customer", text_en: "Honesty and understanding the customer", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Fake reviews", text_en: "Fake reviews", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Emoji kawai", text_en: "Only emojis", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Karya", text_en: "False claims", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Trust yana daga cikin muhimman abubuwan online business.",
          explanation_en: "Trust is one of the most important parts of online business."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Customer ya turo screenshot na payment. Me za ka yi?",
          question_en: "A customer sends a payment screenshot. What should you do?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Tabbatar da payment a account ɗinka", text_en: "Confirm the payment in your account", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Aika kaya nan take", text_en: "Ship immediately", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Tambayi OTP", text_en: "Ask for an OTP", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Gaskata screenshot kawai", text_en: "Trust only the screenshot", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Ka tabbatar da payment a account ko dashboard kafin ka aika kaya.",
          explanation_en: "Confirm the payment in your account or dashboard before shipping."
        },
        {
          question_ha: "Me ya kamata ka yi idan customer ya yi complaint?",
          question_en: "What should you do when a customer complains?",
          options: [
            { text_ha: "Ka saurara ka nemi mafita", text_en: "Listen and look for a solution", correct: true },
            { text_ha: "Ka yi ignore", text_en: "Ignore them", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ka yi gardama", text_en: "Argue", correct: false },
            { text_ha: "Ka yi ƙarya", text_en: "Lie", correct: false }
          ],
          explanation_ha: "Sauraro da neman mafita suna taimaka wajen gina trust.",
          explanation_en: "Listening and solving problems help build customer trust."
        }
      ]
    }

  ],


  /* ============================================================
