  opportunities: {

    intro_ha:
      "Kafin ka nemi kowace dama, ka tabbatar da cewa dama ta fito daga tushe mai aminci.\n\n" +

      "**Abubuwan da ya kamata ka duba:**\n" +
      "- Shin akwai official website?\n" +
      "- Shin organization ɗin tana da official social media account?\n" +
      "- Shin bayanin opportunity ɗin ya bayyana eligibility?\n" +
      "- Shin akwai deadline ko application period?\n" +
      "- Shin ana iya tabbatar da announcement ɗin daga official source?\n" +
      "- Shin link ɗin da kake amfani da shi official ne?\n\n" +

      "**Ka kula da kuɗi.**\n" +
      "Wasu shirye-shirye na iya samun legitimate fees a wasu yanayi, amma kada ka biya kuɗi kawai saboda wani random person ya ce maka za ka samu grant ko aiki. Ka tabbatar da official requirements.\n\n" +

      "**Kada ka ba kowa OTP, PIN ko password.**\n" +
      "Damar karatu, grant ko job ba ta buƙatar ka ba random person sirrin bank account ɗinka.\n\n" +

      "**Kafin ka submit application:**\n" +
      "Ka karanta eligibility, deadline, required documents da privacy information. Ka tabbatar kana amfani da official application page.\n\n" +

      "Ka tuna: **samun dama ba ya fara da cike form kawai; yana fara da tabbatar da cewa damar gaskiya ce.**",

    intro_en:
      "Before applying for any opportunity, verify that it comes from a trustworthy source.\n\n" +

      "**Things to check:**\n" +
      "- Is there an official website?\n" +
      "- Does the organization have official social media accounts?\n" +
      "- Are the eligibility requirements clearly explained?\n" +
      "- Is there an application period or deadline?\n" +
      "- Can the announcement be confirmed through an official source?\n" +
      "- Is the application link official?\n\n" +

      "**Be careful with payments.**\n" +
      "Some programs may have legitimate fees in certain situations, but do not pay simply because a random person promises you a grant or job. Verify the official requirements.\n\n" +

      "**Never give anyone your OTP, PIN, or password.**\n" +
      "A grant, training program, or job opportunity should not require you to give a random person your banking credentials.\n\n" +

      "**Before submitting an application:**\n" +
      "Read the eligibility requirements, deadline, required documents, and privacy information. Make sure you are using the official application page.\n\n" +

      "Remember: **finding an opportunity starts with verifying that the opportunity is genuine.**",

